				</div>
				<h1 id="firstHeading" class="firstHeading mw-first-heading"><span class="mw-page-title-main">Relics List</span></h1>
				<div id="bodyContent" class="vector-body">
					<div id="siteSub" class="noprint">From Slay the Spire Wiki</div>
					<div id="contentSub"></div>
					<div id="contentSub2"></div>
					
					<div id="jump-to-nav"></div>
					<a class="mw-jump-link" href="#mw-head">Jump to navigation</a>
					<a class="mw-jump-link" href="#searchInput">Jump to search</a>
					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr"><div class="game-tabber noexcerpt"><div class="game-tab" style="border: 2px solid var(--wiki-accent-color--hover); border-bottom: none;"><a class="mw-selflink selflink">Slay the Spire</a></div> <div class="game-tab"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Relics_List" title="Slay the Spire 2:Relics List">Slay the Spire 2</a></div></div>
<div class="ambox" style="--ambox-color: var(--highlight-color-boss);"><div class="ambox-icon metadata"><img alt="" src="/images/thumb/Necronomicon.png/48px-Necronomicon.png?8cf1d9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" srcset="/images/thumb/Necronomicon.png/72px-Necronomicon.png?8cf1d9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Necronomicon.png/96px-Necronomicon.png?8cf1d9 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></div><div class="ambox-content"><p class="ambox-text"><i>This is the list of every relic in Slay the Spire. Information about <b>Relics</b> can be found at <a href="/wiki/Relics" title="Relics">Relics</a>.</i></p></div></div>
<div><div id="relic-filters"></div><div id="results"><div id="sortingResults">Default sorting</div><div id="numResults">Showing 193 results</div></div><div id="relicsContainer" class="list-container" data-sequel="1"><div class="relic-box" data-name="Burning Blood" data-rarity="Starter" data-character="Ironclad" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Burning_Blood" title="Burning Blood"><img alt="BurningBlood.png" src="/images/thumb/BurningBlood.png/80px-BurningBlood.png?8523b5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/BurningBlood.png/120px-BurningBlood.png?8523b5 1.5x, /images/BurningBlood.png?8523b5 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Burning_Blood" title="Burning Blood">Burning Blood</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Starter - Ironclad</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the end of combat, heal 6 HP.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Your body's own blood burns with an undying rage.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Ring of the Snake" data-rarity="Starter" data-character="Silent" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Draw"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Snake" title="Ring of the Snake"><img alt="RingoftheSnake.png" src="/images/thumb/RingoftheSnake.png/80px-RingoftheSnake.png?428c38" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/RingoftheSnake.png/120px-RingoftheSnake.png?428c38 1.5x, /images/RingoftheSnake.png?428c38 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Snake" title="Ring of the Snake">Ring of the Snake</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Starter - Silent</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of each combat, draw 2 additional cards.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Made from a fossilized snake. Represents great skill as a huntress.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Cracked Core" data-rarity="Starter" data-character="Defect" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Channel Lightning"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Cracked_Core" title="Cracked Core"><img alt="CrackedCore.png" src="/images/thumb/CrackedCore.png/80px-CrackedCore.png?ede094" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/CrackedCore.png/120px-CrackedCore.png?ede094 1.5x, /images/CrackedCore.png?ede094 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Cracked_Core" title="Cracked Core">Cracked Core</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Starter - Defect</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of each combat, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Channel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Channel</span></a></span> 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Lightning" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Lightning" title="Lightning"><img alt="LightningOrb.png" src="/images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/18px-LightningOrb.png?295517" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/27px-LightningOrb.png?295517 1.5x, /images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/36px-LightningOrb.png?295517 2x" data-file-width="70" data-file-height="70" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Lightning" title="Lightning"><span title="">Lightning</span></a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The mysterious life force which powers the Automatons within the Spire. It appears to be cracked.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Pure Water" data-rarity="Starter" data-character="Watcher" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Pure_Water" title="Pure Water"><img alt="PureWater.png" src="/images/thumb/PureWater.png/80px-PureWater.png?686c9c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/PureWater.png/120px-PureWater.png?686c9c 1.5x, /images/PureWater.png?686c9c 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Pure_Water" title="Pure Water">Pure Water</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Starter - Watcher</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of each combat, add 1 <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Miracle" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Miracle" title="Miracle"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Miracle" title="Miracle">Miracle</a></span> into your hand.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Filtered through fine sand and free of impurities.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Akabeko" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Vigor"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Akabeko" title="Akabeko"><img alt="Akabeko.png" src="/images/thumb/Akabeko.png/80px-Akabeko.png?7b1267" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Akabeko.png/120px-Akabeko.png?7b1267 1.5x, /images/Akabeko.png?7b1267 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Akabeko" title="Akabeko">Akabeko</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Your first <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Attack"><span>Attack</span></a></span> each combat deals 8 additional damage</div><div class="relic-flavor">Muuu~</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Anchor" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Block"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Anchor" title="Anchor"><img alt="Anchor.png" src="/images/thumb/Anchor.png/80px-Anchor.png?482b65" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Anchor.png/120px-Anchor.png?482b65 1.5x, /images/Anchor.png?482b65 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Anchor" title="Anchor">Anchor</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Start each combat with 10 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Holding this miniature trinket, you feel heavier and more stable.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Ancient Tea Set" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Energy"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Ancient_Tea_Set" title="Ancient Tea Set"><img alt="AncientTeaSet.png" src="/images/thumb/AncientTeaSet.png/80px-AncientTeaSet.png?4ca779" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/AncientTeaSet.png/120px-AncientTeaSet.png?4ca779 1.5x, /images/AncientTeaSet.png?4ca779 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Ancient_Tea_Set" title="Ancient Tea Set">Ancient Tea Set</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you enter a Rest Site, start the next combat with 2 extra <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The key to a refreshing night's rest.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Art of War" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Energy"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Art_of_War" title="Art of War"><img alt="ArtofWar.png" src="/images/thumb/ArtofWar.png/80px-ArtofWar.png?4a70c5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/ArtofWar.png/120px-ArtofWar.png?4a70c5 1.5x, /images/ArtofWar.png?4a70c5 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Art_of_War" title="Art of War">Art of War</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">If you do not play any <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Attack"><span>Attacks</span></a></span> during your turn, gain an additional <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span> next turn.</div><div class="relic-flavor">This ancient manuscript contains wisdom from a past age.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Bag of Marbles" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Vulnerable"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Bag_of_Marbles" title="Bag of Marbles"><img alt="BagofMarbles.png" src="/images/thumb/BagofMarbles.png/80px-BagofMarbles.png?731ec4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/BagofMarbles.png/120px-BagofMarbles.png?731ec4 1.5x, /images/BagofMarbles.png?731ec4 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Bag_of_Marbles" title="Bag of Marbles">Bag of Marbles</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of each combat, apply 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vulnerable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable"><img alt="Icon Vulnerable.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/22px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/33px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/44px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</a></span> to ALL enemies.</div><div class="relic-flavor">A once popular toy in the City. Useful for throwing enemies off balance.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Bag of Preparation" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Draw"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Bag_of_Preparation" title="Bag of Preparation"><img alt="BagofPreparation.png" src="/images/thumb/BagofPreparation.png/80px-BagofPreparation.png?9d3fc5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/BagofPreparation.png/120px-BagofPreparation.png?9d3fc5 1.5x, /images/BagofPreparation.png?9d3fc5 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Bag_of_Preparation" title="Bag of Preparation">Bag of Preparation</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of each combat, draw 2 additional cards.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Oversized adventurer's pack. Has many pockets and straps.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Blood Vial" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Blood_Vial" title="Blood Vial"><img alt="BloodVial.png" src="/images/thumb/BloodVial.png/80px-BloodVial.png?da111b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/BloodVial.png/120px-BloodVial.png?da111b 1.5x, /images/BloodVial.png?da111b 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Blood_Vial" title="Blood Vial">Blood Vial</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of each combat, heal 2 HP.</div><div class="relic-flavor">A vial containing the blood of a pure and elder vampire.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Bronze Scales" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Thorns"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Bronze_Scales" title="Bronze Scales"><img alt="BronzeScales.png" src="/images/thumb/BronzeScales.png/80px-BronzeScales.png?855621" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/BronzeScales.png/120px-BronzeScales.png?855621 1.5x, /images/BronzeScales.png?855621 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Bronze_Scales" title="Bronze Scales">Bronze Scales</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Start each combat with 3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Thorns" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Thorns" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Thorns.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Thorns.png/22px-Icon_Thorns.png?8d2a8b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Thorns.png/33px-Icon_Thorns.png?8d2a8b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Thorns.png/44px-Icon_Thorns.png?8d2a8b 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Buffs#Thorns" title="Buffs">Thorns</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The sharp scales of the Guardian. Rearranges itself to protect its user.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Centennial Puzzle" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Draw"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Centennial_Puzzle" title="Centennial Puzzle"><img alt="CentennialPuzzle.png" src="/images/thumb/CentennialPuzzle.png/80px-CentennialPuzzle.png?233df9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/CentennialPuzzle.png/120px-CentennialPuzzle.png?233df9 1.5x, /images/CentennialPuzzle.png?233df9 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Centennial_Puzzle" title="Centennial Puzzle">Centennial Puzzle</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">The first time you lose HP each combat, draw 3 cards.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Upon solving the puzzle you feel a powerful warmth in your chest.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Ceramic Fish" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Deck"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Ceramic_Fish" title="Ceramic Fish"><img alt="CeramicFish.png" src="/images/thumb/CeramicFish.png/80px-CeramicFish.png?dc54db" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/CeramicFish.png/120px-CeramicFish.png?dc54db 1.5x, /images/CeramicFish.png?dc54db 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Ceramic_Fish" title="Ceramic Fish">Ceramic Fish</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you add a card to your deck, gain 9 <a href="/wiki/Gold" title="Gold">Gold</a>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Meticulously painted, these fish were revered to bring great fortune.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Dream Catcher" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Deck"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Dream_Catcher" title="Dream Catcher"><img alt="DreamCatcher.png" src="/images/thumb/DreamCatcher.png/80px-DreamCatcher.png?e02803" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/DreamCatcher.png/120px-DreamCatcher.png?e02803 1.5x, /images/DreamCatcher.png?e02803 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Dream_Catcher" title="Dream Catcher">Dream Catcher</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you Rest, you may add a card to your deck.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The northern tribes would often use dream catchers at night, believing they led to self improvement.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Happy Flower" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Energy"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Happy_Flower" title="Happy Flower"><img alt="HappyFlower.png" src="/images/thumb/HappyFlower.png/80px-HappyFlower.png?9b9c9b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/HappyFlower.png/120px-HappyFlower.png?9b9c9b 1.5x, /images/HappyFlower.png?9b9c9b 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Happy_Flower" title="Happy Flower">Happy Flower</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Every 3 turns, gain 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">This unceasingly joyous plant is a popular novelty item among nobles.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Juzu Bracelet" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Juzu_Bracelet" title="Juzu Bracelet"><img alt="JuzuBracelet.png" src="/images/thumb/JuzuBracelet.png/80px-JuzuBracelet.png?3ebfdf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/JuzuBracelet.png/120px-JuzuBracelet.png?3ebfdf 1.5x, /images/JuzuBracelet.png?3ebfdf 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Juzu_Bracelet" title="Juzu Bracelet">Juzu Bracelet</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Regular enemy combats are no longer encountered in&#160;? rooms.</div><div class="relic-flavor">A ward against the unknown.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Lantern" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Energy"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Lantern" title="Lantern"><img alt="Lantern.png" src="/images/thumb/Lantern.png/80px-Lantern.png?6d8a8e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Lantern.png/120px-Lantern.png?6d8a8e 1.5x, /images/Lantern.png?6d8a8e 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Lantern" title="Lantern">Lantern</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Gain 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span> on the first turn of each combat.</div><div class="relic-flavor">An eerie lantern which illuminates only for the wielder.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Maw Bank" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Maw_Bank" title="Maw Bank"><img alt="MawBank.png" src="/images/thumb/MawBank.png/80px-MawBank.png?5fc7d1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/MawBank.png/120px-MawBank.png?5fc7d1 1.5x, /images/MawBank.png?5fc7d1 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Maw_Bank" title="Maw Bank">Maw Bank</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you climb a floor, gain 12 <a href="/wiki/Gold" title="Gold">Gold</a>. No longer works when you spend any <a href="/wiki/Gold" title="Gold">Gold</a> at a shop.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Surprisingly popular, despite maw attacks being a regular occurrence.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Meal Ticket" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Meal_Ticket" title="Meal Ticket"><img alt="MealTicket.png" src="/images/thumb/MealTicket.png/80px-MealTicket.png?e0e58a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/MealTicket.png/120px-MealTicket.png?e0e58a 1.5x, /images/MealTicket.png?e0e58a 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Meal_Ticket" title="Meal Ticket">Meal Ticket</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you enter a shop, heal 15 HP.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Complimentary meatballs with every visit!</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Nunchaku" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Energy"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Nunchaku" title="Nunchaku"><img alt="Nunchaku.png" src="/images/thumb/Nunchaku.png/80px-Nunchaku.png?cc0f75" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Nunchaku.png/120px-Nunchaku.png?cc0f75 1.5x, /images/Nunchaku.png?cc0f75 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Nunchaku" title="Nunchaku">Nunchaku</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Every time you play 10 <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Attack"><span>Attacks</span></a></span>, gain 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">A good training tool. Improves the posture and agility of the wielder.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Oddly Smooth Stone" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Dexterity"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Oddly_Smooth_Stone" title="Oddly Smooth Stone"><img alt="OddlySmoothStone.png" src="/images/thumb/OddlySmoothStone.png/80px-OddlySmoothStone.png?4bd185" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/OddlySmoothStone.png/120px-OddlySmoothStone.png?4bd185 1.5x, /images/OddlySmoothStone.png?4bd185 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Oddly_Smooth_Stone" title="Oddly Smooth Stone">Oddly Smooth Stone</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of each combat, gain 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dexterity" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dexterity" title="Dexterity"><img alt="Icon Dexterity.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/22px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/33px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/44px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dexterity" title="Dexterity">Dexterity</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">You have never seen something so smooth and pristine. This must be the work of the Ancients.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Omamori" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Omamori" title="Omamori"><img alt="Omamori.png" src="/images/thumb/Omamori.png/80px-Omamori.png?d495e7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Omamori.png/120px-Omamori.png?d495e7 1.5x, /images/Omamori.png?d495e7 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Omamori" title="Omamori">Omamori</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Negate the next 2 <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Curse"><span>Curses</span></a></span> you obtain.</div><div class="relic-flavor">A common charm for staving off vile spirits. This one seems to possess a spark of divine energy.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Orichalcum" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Block"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Orichalcum" title="Orichalcum"><img alt="Orichalcum.png" src="/images/thumb/Orichalcum.png/80px-Orichalcum.png?c37c55" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Orichalcum.png/120px-Orichalcum.png?c37c55 1.5x, /images/Orichalcum.png?c37c55 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Orichalcum" title="Orichalcum">Orichalcum</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">If you end your turn without <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>, gain 6 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">A green tinted metal of an unknown origin. Seemingly indestructible.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Pen Nib" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Pen_Nib" title="Pen Nib"><img alt="PenNib.png" src="/images/thumb/PenNib.png/80px-PenNib.png?3d858e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/PenNib.png/120px-PenNib.png?3d858e 1.5x, /images/PenNib.png?3d858e 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Pen_Nib" title="Pen Nib">Pen Nib</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Every 10th <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Attack"><span>Attack</span></a></span> you play deals double damage.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Holding the nib, you can see everyone ever slain by a previous owner of the pen. A violent history.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Potion Belt" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Potion_Belt" title="Potion Belt"><img alt="PotionBelt.png" src="/images/thumb/PotionBelt.png/80px-PotionBelt.png?21315e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/PotionBelt.png/120px-PotionBelt.png?21315e 1.5x, /images/PotionBelt.png?21315e 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Potion_Belt" title="Potion Belt">Potion Belt</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Upon pickup, gain 2 <a href="/wiki/Potions" title="Potions">Potion</a> slots.</div><div class="relic-flavor">I can hold more Potions using this belt!</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Preserved Insect" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Preserved_Insect" title="Preserved Insect"><img alt="PreservedInsect.png" src="/images/thumb/PreservedInsect.png/80px-PreservedInsect.png?dccac3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/PreservedInsect.png/120px-PreservedInsect.png?dccac3 1.5x, /images/PreservedInsect.png?dccac3 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Preserved_Insect" title="Preserved Insect">Preserved Insect</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Enemies in Elite combats have 25% less HP.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The insect seems to create a shrinking aura that targets particularly large enemies.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Regal Pillow" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Regal_Pillow" title="Regal Pillow"><img alt="RegalPillow.png" src="/images/thumb/RegalPillow.png/80px-RegalPillow.png?cf6f19" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/RegalPillow.png/120px-RegalPillow.png?cf6f19 1.5x, /images/RegalPillow.png?cf6f19 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Regal_Pillow" title="Regal Pillow">Regal Pillow</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you Rest, heal an additional 15 HP.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Now you can get a proper night's rest.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Smiling Mask" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Smiling_Mask" title="Smiling Mask"><img alt="SmilingMask.png" src="/images/thumb/SmilingMask.png/80px-SmilingMask.png?2f04cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/SmilingMask.png/120px-SmilingMask.png?2f04cd 1.5x, /images/SmilingMask.png?2f04cd 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Smiling_Mask" title="Smiling Mask">Smiling Mask</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">The merchant's card removal service now always costs 50 <a href="/wiki/Gold" title="Gold">Gold</a>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Mask worn by the merchant. He must have spares...</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Strawberry" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Strawberry" title="Strawberry"><img alt="Strawberry.png" src="/images/thumb/Strawberry.png/80px-Strawberry.png?80ad49" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Strawberry.png/120px-Strawberry.png?80ad49 1.5x, /images/Strawberry.png?80ad49 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Strawberry" title="Strawberry">Strawberry</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Upon pickup, raise your Max HP by 7.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"Delicious! Haven't seen any of these since the blight." - Ranwid</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="The Boot" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/The_Boot" title="The Boot"><img alt="Boot.png" src="/images/thumb/Boot.png/80px-Boot.png?9956a3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Boot.png/120px-Boot.png?9956a3 1.5x, /images/Boot.png?9956a3 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/The_Boot" title="The Boot">The Boot</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you would deal 4 or less unblocked <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Attack"><span>Attack</span></a></span> damage, increase it to 5.</div><div class="relic-flavor">When wound up, the boot grows larger in size.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Tiny Chest" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Tiny_Chest" title="Tiny Chest"><img alt="TinyChest.png" src="/images/thumb/TinyChest.png/80px-TinyChest.png?598a33" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/TinyChest.png/120px-TinyChest.png?598a33 1.5x, /images/TinyChest.png?598a33 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Tiny_Chest" title="Tiny Chest">Tiny Chest</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Every 4th&#160;? room is a Treasure room.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"A fine prototype." - The Architect</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Toy Ornithopter" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Toy_Ornithopter" title="Toy Ornithopter"><img alt="ToyOrnithopter.png" src="/images/thumb/ToyOrnithopter.png/80px-ToyOrnithopter.png?379d4d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/ToyOrnithopter.png/120px-ToyOrnithopter.png?379d4d 1.5x, /images/ToyOrnithopter.png?379d4d 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Toy_Ornithopter" title="Toy Ornithopter">Toy Ornithopter</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you use a <a href="/wiki/Potions" title="Potions">potion</a>, heal 5 HP.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"This little toy is the perfect companion for the lone adventurer!"</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Vajra" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Strength"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Vajra" title="Vajra"><img alt="Vajra.png" src="/images/thumb/Vajra.png/80px-Vajra.png?39bb77" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Vajra.png/120px-Vajra.png?39bb77 1.5x, /images/Vajra.png?39bb77 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Vajra" title="Vajra">Vajra</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of each combat, gain 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">An ornamental relic given to warriors displaying glory in battle.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="War Paint" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Upgrade"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/War_Paint" title="War Paint"><img alt="WarPaint.png" src="/images/thumb/WarPaint.png/80px-WarPaint.png?9de612" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/WarPaint.png/120px-WarPaint.png?9de612 1.5x, /images/WarPaint.png?9de612 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/War_Paint" title="War Paint">War Paint</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Upon pick up, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Upgrade" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Upgrade" title="Upgrade">Upgrade</a></span> 2 random <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Skill"><span>Skills</span></a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">In the past, Ironclads would create wards using enchanted war paint before charging into battle.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Whetstone" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Upgrade"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Whetstone" title="Whetstone"><img alt="Whetstone.png" src="/images/thumb/Whetstone.png/80px-Whetstone.png?21d916" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Whetstone.png/120px-Whetstone.png?21d916 1.5x, /images/Whetstone.png?21d916 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Whetstone" title="Whetstone">Whetstone</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Upon pickup, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Upgrade" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Upgrade" title="Upgrade">Upgrade</a></span> 2 random <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Attack"><span>Attacks</span></a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"Flesh never beats steel." - Kublai the Great</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Red Skull" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Ironclad" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Strength"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Red_Skull" title="Red Skull"><img alt="RedSkull.png" src="/images/thumb/RedSkull.png/80px-RedSkull.png?69d859" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/RedSkull.png/120px-RedSkull.png?69d859 1.5x, /images/RedSkull.png?69d859 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Red_Skull" title="Red Skull">Red Skull</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Ironclad</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">While your HP is at or below 50%, you have 3 additional <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">A small skull covered in ornamental paint.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Snecko Skull" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Silent" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Poison Poison"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Snecko_Skull" title="Snecko Skull"><img alt="SnakeSkull.png" src="/images/thumb/SnakeSkull.png/80px-SnakeSkull.png?40fc82" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/SnakeSkull.png/120px-SnakeSkull.png?40fc82 1.5x, /images/SnakeSkull.png?40fc82 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Snecko_Skull" title="Snecko Skull">Snecko Skull</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Silent</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you apply <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Poison" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Poison" title="Poison"><img alt="Icon Poison.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Poison.png/22px-Icon_Poison.png?628f4a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Poison.png/33px-Icon_Poison.png?628f4a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Poison.png/44px-Icon_Poison.png?628f4a 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Poison" title="Poison">Poison</a></span>, apply an additional 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Poison" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Poison" title="Poison"><img alt="Icon Poison.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Poison.png/22px-Icon_Poison.png?628f4a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Poison.png/33px-Icon_Poison.png?628f4a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Poison.png/44px-Icon_Poison.png?628f4a 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Poison" title="Poison">Poison</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">A snecko skull in pristine condition. Mysteriously clean and smooth, dirt and grime fall off inexplicably.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Data Disk" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Defect" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Focus"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Data_Disk" title="Data Disk"><img alt="DataDisk.png" src="/images/thumb/DataDisk.png/80px-DataDisk.png?52f6e1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/DataDisk.png/120px-DataDisk.png?52f6e1 1.5x, /images/DataDisk.png?52f6e1 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Data_Disk" title="Data Disk">Data Disk</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Defect</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Start each combat with 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Focus" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><img alt="Icon Focus.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/22px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/33px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/44px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs">Focus</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">This disk contains precious data on birds and snakes.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Damaru" data-rarity="Common" data-character="Watcher" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Mantra"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Damaru" title="Damaru"><img alt="Damaru.png" src="/images/thumb/Damaru.png/80px-Damaru.png?f61b25" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Damaru.png/120px-Damaru.png?f61b25 1.5x, /images/Damaru.png?f61b25 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Damaru" title="Damaru">Damaru</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Common - Watcher</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of your turn, gain 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Mantra" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Mantra.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/22px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/33px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/44px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs">Mantra</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The sound of the small drum keeps your mind awake, revealing a path forward.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Blue Candle" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Exhaust Unplayable"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Blue_Candle" title="Blue Candle"><img alt="BlueCandle.png" src="/images/thumb/BlueCandle.png/80px-BlueCandle.png?f5dce2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/BlueCandle.png/120px-BlueCandle.png?f5dce2 1.5x, /images/BlueCandle.png?f5dce2 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Blue_Candle" title="Blue Candle">Blue Candle</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Unplayable" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Unplayable" title="Keywords">Unplayable</a></span> <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Curse"><span>Curse</span></a></span> cards can now be played. <br />Whenever you play a <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Curse"><span>Curse</span></a></span>, lose 1 HP and <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span> it.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The flame ignites when shrouded in darkness.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Bottled Flame" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Hand"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Bottled_Flame" title="Bottled Flame"><img alt="BottledFlame.png" src="/images/thumb/BottledFlame.png/80px-BottledFlame.png?c71103" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/BottledFlame.png/120px-BottledFlame.png?c71103 1.5x, /images/BottledFlame.png?c71103 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Bottled_Flame" title="Bottled Flame">Bottled Flame</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Upon pickup, choose an <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Attack"><span>Attack</span></a></span> card. <br />At the start of each combat, this card will be in your hand.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Inside the bottle resides a flame that eternally burns.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Bottled Lightning" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Hand"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Bottled_Lightning" title="Bottled Lightning"><img alt="BottledLightning.png" src="/images/thumb/BottledLightning.png/80px-BottledLightning.png?fc670e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/BottledLightning.png/120px-BottledLightning.png?fc670e 1.5x, /images/BottledLightning.png?fc670e 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Bottled_Lightning" title="Bottled Lightning">Bottled Lightning</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Upon pickup, choose a <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Skill"><span>Skill</span></a></span> card. <br />At the start of each combat, this card will be in your hand.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Peering into the swirling maelstrom, you see a part of yourself staring back.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Bottled Tornado" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Hand"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Bottled_Tornado" title="Bottled Tornado"><img alt="BottledTornado.png" src="/images/thumb/BottledTornado.png/80px-BottledTornado.png?7da271" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/BottledTornado.png/120px-BottledTornado.png?7da271 1.5x, /images/BottledTornado.png?7da271 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Bottled_Tornado" title="Bottled Tornado">Bottled Tornado</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Upon pickup, choose a <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Power"><span>Power</span></a></span> card. <br />At the start of each combat, this card will be in your hand.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The bottle gently hums and whirs.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Darkstone Periapt" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Darkstone_Periapt" title="Darkstone Periapt"><img alt="DarkstonePeriapt.png" src="/images/thumb/DarkstonePeriapt.png/80px-DarkstonePeriapt.png?57fd9a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/DarkstonePeriapt.png/120px-DarkstonePeriapt.png?57fd9a 1.5x, /images/DarkstonePeriapt.png?57fd9a 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Darkstone_Periapt" title="Darkstone Periapt">Darkstone Periapt</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you obtain a <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Curse"><span>Curse</span></a></span>, increase your Max HP by 6</div><div class="relic-flavor">The stone draws power from dark energy, converting it into vitality for the wearer.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Eternal Feather" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Deck"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Eternal_Feather" title="Eternal Feather"><img alt="EternalFeather.png" src="/images/thumb/EternalFeather.png/80px-EternalFeather.png?f2ee40" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/EternalFeather.png/120px-EternalFeather.png?f2ee40 1.5x, /images/EternalFeather.png?f2ee40 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Eternal_Feather" title="Eternal Feather">Eternal Feather</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">For every 5 cards in your deck, heal 3 HP whenever you enter a Rest Site.</div><div class="relic-flavor">This feather appears to be completely indestructible. What bird does this possibly come from?</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Frozen Egg" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Deck Upgrade"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Frozen_Egg" title="Frozen Egg"><img alt="FrozenEgg2.png" src="/images/thumb/FrozenEgg2.png/80px-FrozenEgg2.png?3f3220" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/FrozenEgg2.png/120px-FrozenEgg2.png?3f3220 1.5x, /images/FrozenEgg2.png?3f3220 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Frozen_Egg" title="Frozen Egg">Frozen Egg</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you add a <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Power"><span>Power</span></a></span> card to your deck, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Upgrade" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Upgrade" title="Upgrade">Upgrade</a></span> it.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The egg lies inert and frozen, never to hatch.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Gremlin Horn" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Draw Energy"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Gremlin_Horn" title="Gremlin Horn"><img alt="GremlinHorn.png" src="/images/thumb/GremlinHorn.png/80px-GremlinHorn.png?ff7334" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/GremlinHorn.png/120px-GremlinHorn.png?ff7334 1.5x, /images/GremlinHorn.png?ff7334 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Gremlin_Horn" title="Gremlin Horn">Gremlin Horn</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever an enemy dies, gain 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span> and draw 1 card.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"Gremlin Nobs are capable of growing until the day they die. Remarkable." - Ranwid</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Horn Cleat" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Block"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Horn_Cleat" title="Horn Cleat"><img alt="HornCleat.png" src="/images/thumb/HornCleat.png/80px-HornCleat.png?645d88" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/HornCleat.png/120px-HornCleat.png?645d88 1.5x, /images/HornCleat.png?645d88 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Horn_Cleat" title="Horn Cleat">Horn Cleat</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of your 2nd turn, gain 14 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block">Block</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Pleasant to hold in the hand. What was it for?</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Ink Bottle" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Draw"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Ink_Bottle" title="Ink Bottle"><img alt="InkBottle.png" src="/images/thumb/InkBottle.png/80px-InkBottle.png?5f16bb" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/InkBottle.png/120px-InkBottle.png?5f16bb 1.5x, /images/InkBottle.png?5f16bb 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Ink_Bottle" title="Ink Bottle">Ink Bottle</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you play 10 cards, draw 1 card.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Once exhausted, appears to refill itself in a different color.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Kunai" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Dexterity"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Kunai" title="Kunai"><img alt="Kunai.png" src="/images/thumb/Kunai.png/80px-Kunai.png?391b36" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Kunai.png/120px-Kunai.png?391b36 1.5x, /images/Kunai.png?391b36 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Kunai" title="Kunai">Kunai</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Every time you play 3 <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Attack"><span>Attacks</span></a></span> in a single turn, gain 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dexterity" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dexterity" title="Dexterity"><img alt="Icon Dexterity.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/22px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/33px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/44px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dexterity" title="Dexterity">Dexterity</a></span></div><div class="relic-flavor">A blade favored by assassins for its lethality at range.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Letter Opener" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Letter_Opener" title="Letter Opener"><img alt="LetterOpener.png" src="/images/thumb/LetterOpener.png/80px-LetterOpener.png?2bc511" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/LetterOpener.png/120px-LetterOpener.png?2bc511 1.5x, /images/LetterOpener.png?2bc511 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Letter_Opener" title="Letter Opener">Letter Opener</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Every time you play 3 <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Skill"><span>Skills</span></a></span> in a single turn, deal 5 damage to ALL enemies.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Unnaturally sharp.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Matryoshka" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Matryoshka" title="Matryoshka"><img alt="Matryoshka.png" src="/images/thumb/Matryoshka.png/80px-Matryoshka.png?5adf8f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Matryoshka.png/120px-Matryoshka.png?5adf8f 1.5x, /images/Matryoshka.png?5adf8f 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Matryoshka" title="Matryoshka">Matryoshka</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">The next 2 non-boss chests you open contain 2 Relics.</div><div class="relic-flavor">A stackable set of painted dolls. The paint depicts an unknown bird with white eyes and blue feathers.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Meat on the Bone" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Meat_on_the_Bone" title="Meat on the Bone"><img alt="MeatontheBone.png" src="/images/thumb/MeatontheBone.png/80px-MeatontheBone.png?f91a4b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/MeatontheBone.png/120px-MeatontheBone.png?f91a4b 1.5x, /images/MeatontheBone.png?f91a4b 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Meat_on_the_Bone" title="Meat on the Bone">Meat on the Bone</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">If your HP is at or below 50% at the end of combat, heal 12 HP.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The meat keeps replenishing, never seeming to fully run out.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Mercury Hourglass" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Mercury_Hourglass" title="Mercury Hourglass"><img alt="MercuryHourglass.png" src="/images/thumb/MercuryHourglass.png/80px-MercuryHourglass.png?a6aafb" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/MercuryHourglass.png/120px-MercuryHourglass.png?a6aafb 1.5x, /images/MercuryHourglass.png?a6aafb 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Mercury_Hourglass" title="Mercury Hourglass">Mercury Hourglass</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of your turn, deal 3 damage to ALL enemies.</div><div class="relic-flavor">An enchanted hourglass that endlessly drips.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Molten Egg" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Deck Upgrade"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Molten_Egg" title="Molten Egg"><img alt="MoltenEgg2.png" src="/images/thumb/MoltenEgg2.png/80px-MoltenEgg2.png?6d8f02" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/MoltenEgg2.png/120px-MoltenEgg2.png?6d8f02 1.5x, /images/MoltenEgg2.png?6d8f02 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Molten_Egg" title="Molten Egg">Molten Egg</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you add an <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Attack"><span>Attack</span></a></span> card to your deck, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Upgrade" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Upgrade" title="Upgrade">Upgrade</a></span> it.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The egg of a Phoenix. It glows red hot with a simmering lava.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Mummified Hand" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Hand"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Mummified_Hand" title="Mummified Hand"><img alt="MummifiedHand.png" src="/images/thumb/MummifiedHand.png/80px-MummifiedHand.png?dd905c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/MummifiedHand.png/120px-MummifiedHand.png?dd905c 1.5x, /images/MummifiedHand.png?dd905c 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Mummified_Hand" title="Mummified Hand">Mummified Hand</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you play a <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Power"><span>Power</span></a></span> card, a random card in your hand costs 0 that turn.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Frequently twitches, especially when your pulse is high.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Ornamental Fan" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Block"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Ornamental_Fan" title="Ornamental Fan"><img alt="OrnamentalFan.png" src="/images/thumb/OrnamentalFan.png/80px-OrnamentalFan.png?a1aeed" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/OrnamentalFan.png/120px-OrnamentalFan.png?a1aeed 1.5x, /images/OrnamentalFan.png?a1aeed 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Ornamental_Fan" title="Ornamental Fan">Ornamental Fan</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Every time you play 3 <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Attack"><span>Attacks</span></a></span> in a single turn, gain 4 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The fan seems to extend and harden as blood is spilled.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Pantograph" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Pantograph" title="Pantograph"><img alt="Pantograph.png" src="/images/thumb/Pantograph.png/80px-Pantograph.png?da972c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Pantograph.png/120px-Pantograph.png?da972c 1.5x, /images/Pantograph.png?da972c 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Pantograph" title="Pantograph">Pantograph</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of Boss combats, heal 25 HP.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"Solid foundations are not accidental. Tools for planning are a must." - The Architect</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Pear" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Pear" title="Pear"><img alt="Pear.png" src="/images/thumb/Pear.png/80px-Pear.png?3ea4bd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Pear.png/120px-Pear.png?3ea4bd 1.5x, /images/Pear.png?3ea4bd 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Pear" title="Pear">Pear</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Upon pickup, raise your Max HP by 10.</div><div class="relic-flavor">A common fruit before the Spireblight.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Question Card" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Question_Card" title="Question Card"><img alt="QuestionCard.png" src="/images/thumb/QuestionCard.png/80px-QuestionCard.png?1b1942" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/QuestionCard.png/120px-QuestionCard.png?1b1942 1.5x, /images/QuestionCard.png?1b1942 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Question_Card" title="Question Card">Question Card</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Future card rewards have 1 additional card to choose from.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"Those with more choices minimize the downside to chaos." - Kublai the Great</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Shuriken" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Strength"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Shuriken" title="Shuriken"><img alt="Shuriken.png" src="/images/thumb/Shuriken.png/80px-Shuriken.png?91b5e9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Shuriken.png/120px-Shuriken.png?91b5e9 1.5x, /images/Shuriken.png?91b5e9 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Shuriken" title="Shuriken">Shuriken</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Every time you play 3 <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Attack"><span>Attacks</span></a></span> in a single turn, gain 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Lightweight throwing weapons. Recommend going for the eyes.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Singing Bowl" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Deck"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Singing_Bowl" title="Singing Bowl"><img alt="SingingBowl.png" src="/images/thumb/SingingBowl.png/80px-SingingBowl.png?20b4b2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/SingingBowl.png/120px-SingingBowl.png?20b4b2 1.5x, /images/SingingBowl.png?20b4b2 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Singing_Bowl" title="Singing Bowl">Singing Bowl</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">When adding cards to your deck, you may raise your Max HP by 2 instead.</div><div class="relic-flavor">This well-used artifact rings out with a beautiful melody when struck.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Strike Dummy" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Strike_Dummy" title="Strike Dummy"><img alt="StrikeDummy.png" src="/images/thumb/StrikeDummy.png/80px-StrikeDummy.png?8d3dda" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/StrikeDummy.png/120px-StrikeDummy.png?8d3dda 1.5x, /images/StrikeDummy.png?8d3dda 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Strike_Dummy" title="Strike Dummy">Strike Dummy</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Cards containing "Strike" deal 3 additional damage.</div><div class="relic-flavor">It's beat up.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Sundial" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Energy"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Sundial" title="Sundial"><img alt="Sundial.png" src="/images/thumb/Sundial.png/80px-Sundial.png?8dca2f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Sundial.png/120px-Sundial.png?8dca2f 1.5x, /images/Sundial.png?8dca2f 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Sundial" title="Sundial">Sundial</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Every 3 times you shuffle your draw pile, gain 2 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"Early man's foolish obsession with time caused them to look to the sky for guidance, hoping for something permanent." - Zoroth</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="The Courier" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/The_Courier" title="The Courier"><img alt="TheCourier.png" src="/images/thumb/TheCourier.png/80px-TheCourier.png?9ba613" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/TheCourier.png/120px-TheCourier.png?9ba613 1.5x, /images/TheCourier.png?9ba613 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/The_Courier" title="The Courier">The Courier</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">The Merchant restocks <a href="/wiki/Cards" title="Cards">cards</a>, <a href="/wiki/Relics" title="Relics">relics</a>, and <a href="/wiki/Potions" title="Potions">potions</a>. All prices are reduced by 20%.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The merchant's personal pet!</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Toxic Egg" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Deck Upgrade"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Toxic_Egg" title="Toxic Egg"><img alt="ToxicEgg2.png" src="/images/thumb/ToxicEgg2.png/80px-ToxicEgg2.png?3b14ea" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/ToxicEgg2.png/120px-ToxicEgg2.png?3b14ea 1.5x, /images/ToxicEgg2.png?3b14ea 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Toxic_Egg" title="Toxic Egg">Toxic Egg</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you add a <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Skill"><span>Skill</span></a></span> card to your deck, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Upgrade" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Upgrade" title="Upgrade">Upgrade</a></span> it.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"What a marvelous discovery! This appears to be the inert egg of some magical creature. Who or what created this?" - Ranwid</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="White Beast Statue" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/White_Beast_Statue" title="White Beast Statue"><img alt="WhiteBeastStatue.png" src="/images/thumb/WhiteBeastStatue.png/80px-WhiteBeastStatue.png?9da036" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/WhiteBeastStatue.png/120px-WhiteBeastStatue.png?9da036 1.5x, /images/WhiteBeastStatue.png?9da036 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/White_Beast_Statue" title="White Beast Statue">White Beast Statue</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc"><a href="/wiki/Potions" title="Potions">Potions</a> always appear in combat rewards.</div><div class="relic-flavor">A small white statue of a creature you have never seen before.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Paper Phrog" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Ironclad" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Exhaust Vulnerable"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Paper_Phrog" title="Paper Phrog"><img alt="PaperFrog.png" src="/images/thumb/PaperFrog.png/80px-PaperFrog.png?a89503" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/PaperFrog.png/120px-PaperFrog.png?a89503 1.5x, /images/PaperFrog.png?a89503 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Paper_Phrog" title="Paper Phrog">Paper Phrog</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Ironclad</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Enemies with <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vulnerable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable"><img alt="Icon Vulnerable.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/22px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/33px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/44px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</a></span> take 75% more damage rather than 50%.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The paper continually folds and unfolds itself into the shape of a small creature.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Self-Forming Clay" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Ironclad" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Block Next Turn Block"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Self-Forming_Clay" title="Self-Forming Clay"><img alt="SelfFormingClay.png" src="/images/thumb/SelfFormingClay.png/80px-SelfFormingClay.png?80d861" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/SelfFormingClay.png/120px-SelfFormingClay.png?80d861 1.5x, /images/SelfFormingClay.png?80d861 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Self-Forming_Clay" title="Self-Forming Clay">Self-Forming Clay</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Ironclad</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you lose HP, gain 3 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span> next turn.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"Most curious! It appears to form itself loosely on my thoughts! Tele-clay?" - Ranwid</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Ninja Scroll" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Silent" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Ninja_Scroll" title="Ninja Scroll"><img alt="NinjaScroll.png" src="/images/thumb/NinjaScroll.png/80px-NinjaScroll.png?5e08bc" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/NinjaScroll.png/120px-NinjaScroll.png?5e08bc 1.5x, /images/NinjaScroll.png?5e08bc 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Ninja_Scroll" title="Ninja Scroll">Ninja Scroll</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Silent</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start each combat, add 3 <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Shiv" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Shiv" title="Shiv"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png?4d1ee4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png?4d1ee4 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Shiv" title="Shiv">Shivs</a></span> into your hand.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Contains the secrets of assassination.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Paper Krane" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Silent" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Weak"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Paper_Krane" title="Paper Krane"><img alt="PaperCrane.png" src="/images/thumb/PaperCrane.png/80px-PaperCrane.png?fa0333" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/PaperCrane.png/120px-PaperCrane.png?fa0333 1.5x, /images/PaperCrane.png?fa0333 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Paper_Krane" title="Paper Krane">Paper Krane</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Silent</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Enemies with <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Weak" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak"><img alt="Icon Weak.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/22px-Icon_Weak.png?261352" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/33px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/44px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak">Weak</a></span> deal 40% less damage rather than 25%.</div><div class="relic-flavor">An origami of a creature from a past age.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Gold-Plated Cables" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Defect" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Orb"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Gold-Plated_Cables" title="Gold-Plated Cables"><img alt="Cables.png" src="/images/thumb/Cables.png/80px-Cables.png?7c74d9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Cables.png/120px-Cables.png?7c74d9 1.5x, /images/Cables.png?7c74d9 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Gold-Plated_Cables" title="Gold-Plated Cables">Gold-Plated Cables</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Defect</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Your rightmost <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Orb" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs">Orb</a></span> triggers its passive an additional time.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"Interesting! Even automatons are affected by placebo." - Ranwid</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Symbiotic Virus" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Defect" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Channel Dark"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Symbiotic_Virus" title="Symbiotic Virus"><img alt="SymbioticVirus.png" src="/images/thumb/SymbioticVirus.png/80px-SymbioticVirus.png?d2272b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/SymbioticVirus.png/120px-SymbioticVirus.png?d2272b 1.5x, /images/SymbioticVirus.png?d2272b 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Symbiotic_Virus" title="Symbiotic Virus">Symbiotic Virus</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Defect</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of each combat, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Channel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Channel</span></a></span> 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dark" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dark" title="Dark"><img alt="DarkOrb.png" src="/images/thumb/DarkOrb.png/18px-DarkOrb.png?895273" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/DarkOrb.png/27px-DarkOrb.png?895273 1.5x, /images/thumb/DarkOrb.png/36px-DarkOrb.png?895273 2x" data-file-width="82" data-file-height="82" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dark" title="Dark"><span title="">Dark</span></a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">A little bit of bad can do a lot of good.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Duality" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Watcher" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Dexterity"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Duality" title="Duality"><img alt="Duality.png" src="/images/thumb/Duality.png/80px-Duality.png?91f1da" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Duality.png/120px-Duality.png?91f1da 1.5x, /images/Duality.png?91f1da 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Duality" title="Duality">Duality</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Watcher</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you play an <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Attack"><span>Attack</span></a></span>, gain 1 temporary <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dexterity" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dexterity" title="Dexterity"><img alt="Icon Dexterity.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/22px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/33px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/44px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dexterity" title="Dexterity">Dexterity</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"And the sun was extinguished forever, as if curtains fell before it." - Zoroth</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Teardrop Locket" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-character="Watcher" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Calm"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Teardrop_Locket" title="Teardrop Locket"><img alt="TeardropLocket.png" src="/images/thumb/TeardropLocket.png/80px-TeardropLocket.png?f3c4dc" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/TeardropLocket.png/120px-TeardropLocket.png?f3c4dc 1.5x, /images/TeardropLocket.png?f3c4dc 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Teardrop_Locket" title="Teardrop Locket">Teardrop Locket</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Uncommon - Watcher</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Start each combat in <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Calm" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Calm</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Its owner blind, its contents unseen.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Bird-Faced Urn" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Bird-Faced_Urn" title="Bird-Faced Urn"><img alt="BirdFacedUrn.png" src="/images/thumb/BirdFacedUrn.png/80px-BirdFacedUrn.png?b67a14" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/BirdFacedUrn.png/120px-BirdFacedUrn.png?b67a14 1.5x, /images/BirdFacedUrn.png?b67a14 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Bird-Faced_Urn" title="Bird-Faced Urn">Bird-Faced Urn</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you play a <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Power"><span>Power</span></a></span> card, heal 2 HP.</div><div class="relic-flavor">This urn shows the crow god Mazaleth looking mischievous.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Calipers" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Block"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Calipers" title="Calipers"><img alt="Calipers.png" src="/images/thumb/Calipers.png/80px-Calipers.png?8c6512" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Calipers.png/120px-Calipers.png?8c6512 1.5x, /images/Calipers.png?8c6512 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Calipers" title="Calipers">Calipers</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of your turn, lose 15 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block">Block</a></span> rather than all of your <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block">Block</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"Mechanical precision leads to greatness" - The Architect</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Captain&#39;s Wheel" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Block"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Captain%27s_Wheel" title="Captain&#39;s Wheel"><img alt="CaptainsWheel.png" src="/images/thumb/CaptainsWheel.png/80px-CaptainsWheel.png?fe5f81" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/CaptainsWheel.png/120px-CaptainsWheel.png?fe5f81 1.5x, /images/CaptainsWheel.png?fe5f81 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Captain%27s_Wheel" title="Captain&#39;s Wheel">Captain's Wheel</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of your 3rd turn, gain 18 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block">Block</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Wooden trinket carved with delicate precision. A name is carved into it but the language is foreign.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Dead Branch" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Exhaust Hand"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Dead_Branch" title="Dead Branch"><img alt="DeadBranch.png" src="/images/thumb/DeadBranch.png/80px-DeadBranch.png?b0e6b0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/DeadBranch.png/120px-DeadBranch.png?b0e6b0 1.5x, /images/DeadBranch.png?b0e6b0 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Dead_Branch" title="Dead Branch">Dead Branch</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span> a card, add a random card to your hand.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The branch of a tree from a forgotten era.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Du-Vu Doll" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Deck Strength"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Du-Vu_Doll" title="Du-Vu Doll"><img alt="Du-VuDoll.png" src="/images/thumb/Du-VuDoll.png/80px-Du-VuDoll.png?1f9346" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Du-VuDoll.png/120px-Du-VuDoll.png?1f9346 1.5x, /images/Du-VuDoll.png?1f9346 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Du-Vu_Doll" title="Du-Vu Doll">Du-Vu Doll</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">For each <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Curse"><span>Curse</span></a></span> in your deck, start each combat with 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">A doll devised to gain strength from malicious energy.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Fossilized Helix" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Buffer"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Fossilized_Helix" title="Fossilized Helix"><img alt="FossilizedHelix.png" src="/images/thumb/FossilizedHelix.png/80px-FossilizedHelix.png?3b5217" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/FossilizedHelix.png/120px-FossilizedHelix.png?3b5217 1.5x, /images/FossilizedHelix.png?3b5217 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Fossilized_Helix" title="Fossilized Helix">Fossilized Helix</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Prevent the first time you would lose HP in combat.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Seemingly indestructible, you wonder what kind of creature this belonged to.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Gambling Chip" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Discard Draw"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Gambling_Chip" title="Gambling Chip"><img alt="GamblingChip.png" src="/images/thumb/GamblingChip.png/80px-GamblingChip.png?61381e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/GamblingChip.png/120px-GamblingChip.png?61381e 1.5x, /images/GamblingChip.png?61381e 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Gambling_Chip" title="Gambling Chip">Gambling Chip</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of each combat, discard any number of cards, then draw that many cards.</div><div class="relic-flavor">You can see a small inscription on one side. It reads: "Bear's Lucky Chip!"</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Ginger" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Weak"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Ginger" title="Ginger"><img alt="Ginger.png" src="/images/thumb/Ginger.png/80px-Ginger.png?f09682" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Ginger.png/120px-Ginger.png?f09682 1.5x, /images/Ginger.png?f09682 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Ginger" title="Ginger">Ginger</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">You can no longer become <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Weak" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak"><img alt="Icon Weak.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/22px-Icon_Weak.png?261352" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/33px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/44px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak">Weakened</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">A potent tool in many tonics.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Girya" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Strength"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Girya" title="Girya"><img alt="Girya.png" src="/images/thumb/Girya.png/80px-Girya.png?44e44f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Girya.png/120px-Girya.png?44e44f 1.5x, /images/Girya.png?44e44f 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Girya" title="Girya">Girya</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">You can now gain <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span> at Rest Sites (up to 3 times).</div><div class="relic-flavor">This Girya is unfathomably heavy. You could train with this to get significantly stronger.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Ice Cream" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Energy"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Ice_Cream" title="Ice Cream"><img alt="IceCream.png" src="/images/thumb/IceCream.png/80px-IceCream.png?80b2a4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/IceCream.png/120px-IceCream.png?80b2a4 1.5x, /images/IceCream.png?80b2a4 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Ice_Cream" title="Ice Cream">Ice Cream</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span> is now conserved between turns.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Delicious!</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Incense Burner" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Intangible"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Incense_Burner" title="Incense Burner"><img alt="IncenseBurner.png" src="/images/thumb/IncenseBurner.png/80px-IncenseBurner.png?1350c5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/IncenseBurner.png/120px-IncenseBurner.png?1350c5 1.5x, /images/IncenseBurner.png?1350c5 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Incense_Burner" title="Incense Burner">Incense Burner</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Every 6 turns, gain 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Intangible" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Intangible" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Intangible.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Intangible.png/22px-Icon_Intangible.png?3d82d7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Intangible.png/33px-Icon_Intangible.png?3d82d7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Intangible.png/44px-Icon_Intangible.png?3d82d7 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Buffs#Intangible" title="Buffs">Intangible</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The smoke imbues its owner with the spirit of the burned.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Lizard Tail" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Lizard_Tail" title="Lizard Tail"><img alt="LizardTail.png" src="/images/thumb/LizardTail.png/80px-LizardTail.png?62d9d8" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/LizardTail.png/120px-LizardTail.png?62d9d8 1.5x, /images/LizardTail.png?62d9d8 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Lizard_Tail" title="Lizard Tail">Lizard Tail</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">When you would die, heal to 50% of your Max HP instead (works once).</div><div class="relic-flavor">A fake tail to trick enemies during combat.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Mango" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Mango" title="Mango"><img alt="Mango.png" src="/images/thumb/Mango.png/80px-Mango.png?7ff233" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Mango.png/120px-Mango.png?7ff233 1.5x, /images/Mango.png?7ff233 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Mango" title="Mango">Mango</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Upon pickup, raise your Max HP by 14.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The most coveted forgotten fruit. Impeccably preserved with no signs of Spireblight.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Old Coin" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Old_Coin" title="Old Coin"><img alt="OldCoin.png" src="/images/thumb/OldCoin.png/80px-OldCoin.png?1c2cf1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/OldCoin.png/120px-OldCoin.png?1c2cf1 1.5x, /images/OldCoin.png?1c2cf1 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Old_Coin" title="Old Coin">Old Coin</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Upon pickup, gain 300 <a href="/wiki/Gold" title="Gold">Gold</a>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Unique coins are highly valued by Merchants for their historical value and rare metallic composition.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Peace Pipe" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Deck"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Peace_Pipe" title="Peace Pipe"><img alt="PeacePipe.png" src="/images/thumb/PeacePipe.png/80px-PeacePipe.png?9c5737" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/PeacePipe.png/120px-PeacePipe.png?9c5737 1.5x, /images/PeacePipe.png?9c5737 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Peace_Pipe" title="Peace Pipe">Peace Pipe</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">You can now remove cards from your deck at Rest Sites.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Clears the mind and cleanses the soul.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Pocketwatch" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Draw"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Pocketwatch" title="Pocketwatch"><img alt="Pocketwatch.png" src="/images/thumb/Pocketwatch.png/80px-Pocketwatch.png?711d76" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Pocketwatch.png/120px-Pocketwatch.png?711d76 1.5x, /images/Pocketwatch.png?711d76 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Pocketwatch" title="Pocketwatch">Pocketwatch</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you play 3 or less cards during your turn, draw 3 additional cards at the start of your next turn.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The hands seem stuck on the 3 o'clock position.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Prayer Wheel" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Prayer_Wheel" title="Prayer Wheel"><img alt="PrayerWheel.png" src="/images/thumb/PrayerWheel.png/80px-PrayerWheel.png?44f961" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/PrayerWheel.png/120px-PrayerWheel.png?44f961 1.5x, /images/PrayerWheel.png?44f961 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Prayer_Wheel" title="Prayer Wheel">Prayer Wheel</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Normal enemies drop an additional card reward.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The wheel continues to spin, never stopping.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Shovel" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Shovel" title="Shovel"><img alt="Shovel.png" src="/images/thumb/Shovel.png/80px-Shovel.png?2ddcce" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Shovel.png/120px-Shovel.png?2ddcce 1.5x, /images/Shovel.png?2ddcce 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Shovel" title="Shovel">Shovel</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">You can now Dig for relics at Rest Sites.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The Spire houses all number of relics from past civilizations and powerful adventurers lost to time. Time to go dig them up!</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Stone Calendar" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Stone_Calendar" title="Stone Calendar"><img alt="StoneCalendar.png" src="/images/thumb/StoneCalendar.png/80px-StoneCalendar.png?23e7f8" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/StoneCalendar.png/120px-StoneCalendar.png?23e7f8 1.5x, /images/StoneCalendar.png?23e7f8 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Stone_Calendar" title="Stone Calendar">Stone Calendar</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the end of turn 7, deal 52 damage to ALL enemies.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The passage of time is imperceptible in the Spire.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Thread and Needle" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Plated Armor"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Thread_and_Needle" title="Thread and Needle"><img alt="ThreadandNeedle.png" src="/images/thumb/ThreadandNeedle.png/80px-ThreadandNeedle.png?99b406" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/ThreadandNeedle.png/120px-ThreadandNeedle.png?99b406 1.5x, /images/ThreadandNeedle.png?99b406 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Thread_and_Needle" title="Thread and Needle">Thread and Needle</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of each combat, gain 4 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Plated Armor" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Plated_Armor" title="Plated Armor"><img alt="Icon PlatedArmor.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_PlatedArmor.png/22px-Icon_PlatedArmor.png?647bdc" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_PlatedArmor.png/33px-Icon_PlatedArmor.png?647bdc 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_PlatedArmor.png/44px-Icon_PlatedArmor.png?647bdc 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Plated_Armor" title="Plated Armor">Plated Armor</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Wrapping the magical thread around your body, you feel harder to the touch.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Torii" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Torii" title="Torii"><img alt="Torii.png" src="/images/thumb/Torii.png/80px-Torii.png?3fa368" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Torii.png/120px-Torii.png?3fa368 1.5x, /images/Torii.png?3fa368 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Torii" title="Torii">Torii</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you would receive 5 or less unblocked <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Attack"><span>Attack</span></a></span> damage, reduce it to 1.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Holding the small Torii, you feel a sense of calm and safety drift through your mind.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Tungsten Rod" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Tungsten_Rod" title="Tungsten Rod"><img alt="TungstenRod.png" src="/images/thumb/TungstenRod.png/80px-TungstenRod.png?1512ee" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/TungstenRod.png/120px-TungstenRod.png?1512ee 1.5x, /images/TungstenRod.png?1512ee 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Tungsten_Rod" title="Tungsten Rod">Tungsten Rod</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you would lose HP, lose 1 less.</div><div class="relic-flavor">It's very very heavy.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Turnip" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Frail"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Turnip" title="Turnip"><img alt="Turnip.png" src="/images/thumb/Turnip.png/80px-Turnip.png?2143e1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Turnip.png/120px-Turnip.png?2143e1 1.5x, /images/Turnip.png?2143e1 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Turnip" title="Turnip">Turnip</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">You can no longer become <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Frail" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Debuffs#Frail" title="Debuffs"><img alt="Icon Frail.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Frail.png/22px-Icon_Frail.png?c2abdd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Frail.png/33px-Icon_Frail.png?c2abdd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Frail.png/44px-Icon_Frail.png?c2abdd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Debuffs#Frail" title="Debuffs">Frail</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Best with Ginger.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Unceasing Top" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Draw"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Unceasing_Top" title="Unceasing Top"><img alt="UnceasingTop.png" src="/images/thumb/UnceasingTop.png/80px-UnceasingTop.png?907f82" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/UnceasingTop.png/120px-UnceasingTop.png?907f82 1.5x, /images/UnceasingTop.png?907f82 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Unceasing_Top" title="Unceasing Top">Unceasing Top</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you have no cards in hand during your turn, draw a card.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The top continues to spin effortlessly as if you were in a dream.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Wing Boots" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Wing_Boots" title="Wing Boots"><img alt="WingedGreaves.png" src="/images/thumb/WingedGreaves.png/80px-WingedGreaves.png?5fef6d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/WingedGreaves.png/120px-WingedGreaves.png?5fef6d 1.5x, /images/WingedGreaves.png?5fef6d 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Wing_Boots" title="Wing Boots">Wing Boots</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">You may ignore paths when choosing the next room to travel to 3 times.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Stylish.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Champion Belt" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Ironclad" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Vulnerable Weak"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Champion_Belt" title="Champion Belt"><img alt="ChampionBelt.png" src="/images/thumb/ChampionBelt.png/80px-ChampionBelt.png?cd2e0b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/ChampionBelt.png/120px-ChampionBelt.png?cd2e0b 1.5x, /images/ChampionBelt.png?cd2e0b 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Champion_Belt" title="Champion Belt">Champion Belt</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Ironclad</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you apply <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vulnerable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable"><img alt="Icon Vulnerable.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/22px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/33px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/44px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</a></span>, also apply 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Weak" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak"><img alt="Icon Weak.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/22px-Icon_Weak.png?261352" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/33px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/44px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak">Weak</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Only the greatest may wear this belt.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Charon&#39;s Ashes" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Ironclad" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Exhaust"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Charon%27s_Ashes" title="Charon&#39;s Ashes"><img alt="CharonsAshes.png" src="/images/thumb/CharonsAshes.png/80px-CharonsAshes.png?33a78a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/CharonsAshes.png/120px-CharonsAshes.png?33a78a 1.5x, /images/CharonsAshes.png?33a78a 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Charon%27s_Ashes" title="Charon&#39;s Ashes">Charon's Ashes</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Ironclad</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span> a card, deal 3 damage to ALL enemies.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Charon was said to be the god of rebirth, eternally dying and reviving in a burst of flame.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Magic Flower" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Ironclad" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Magic_Flower" title="Magic Flower"><img alt="MagicFlower.png" src="/images/thumb/MagicFlower.png/80px-MagicFlower.png?d5df37" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/MagicFlower.png/120px-MagicFlower.png?d5df37 1.5x, /images/MagicFlower.png?d5df37 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Magic_Flower" title="Magic Flower">Magic Flower</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Ironclad</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Healing is 50% more effective during combat.</div><div class="relic-flavor">A flower long thought extinct, somehow preserved in perfect condition.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="The Specimen" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Silent" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Poison"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/The_Specimen" title="The Specimen"><img alt="TheSpecimen.png" src="/images/thumb/TheSpecimen.png/80px-TheSpecimen.png?d3557f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/TheSpecimen.png/120px-TheSpecimen.png?d3557f 1.5x, /images/TheSpecimen.png?d3557f 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/The_Specimen" title="The Specimen">The Specimen</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Silent</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever an enemy dies, transfer any <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Poison" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Poison" title="Poison"><img alt="Icon Poison.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Poison.png/22px-Icon_Poison.png?628f4a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Poison.png/33px-Icon_Poison.png?628f4a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Poison.png/44px-Icon_Poison.png?628f4a 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Poison" title="Poison">Poison</a></span> it has to a random enemy.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"Fascinating! I found a mutated creature demonstrating astounding toxic properties. Storing a sample for later examination." - Ranwid</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Tingsha" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Silent" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Discard"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Tingsha" title="Tingsha"><img alt="Tingsha.png" src="/images/thumb/Tingsha.png/80px-Tingsha.png?891b21" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Tingsha.png/120px-Tingsha.png?891b21 1.5x, /images/Tingsha.png?891b21 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Tingsha" title="Tingsha">Tingsha</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Silent</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you discard a card during your turn, deal 3 damage to a random enemy.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The sound this instrument generates seems to be capable of reverberating to painful levels of volume.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Tough Bandages" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Silent" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Block Discard"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Tough_Bandages" title="Tough Bandages"><img alt="ToughBandages.png" src="/images/thumb/ToughBandages.png/80px-ToughBandages.png?ad78e1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/ToughBandages.png/120px-ToughBandages.png?ad78e1 1.5x, /images/ToughBandages.png?ad78e1 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Tough_Bandages" title="Tough Bandages">Tough Bandages</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Silent</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you discard a card during your turn, gain 3 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block">Block</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Loss gives strength.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Emotion Chip" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Defect" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Orb"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Emotion_Chip" title="Emotion Chip"><img alt="EmotionChip.png" src="/images/thumb/EmotionChip.png/80px-EmotionChip.png?1dd596" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/EmotionChip.png/120px-EmotionChip.png?1dd596 1.5x, /images/EmotionChip.png?1dd596 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Emotion_Chip" title="Emotion Chip">Emotion Chip</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Defect</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">If you lost HP during the previous turn, trigger the passive ability of all <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Orb" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs">Orbs</a></span> at the start of your turn.</div><div class="relic-flavor">...&lt;3...?</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Cloak Clasp" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Watcher" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Block Hand"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Cloak_Clasp" title="Cloak Clasp"><img alt="CloakClasp.png" src="/images/thumb/CloakClasp.png/80px-CloakClasp.png?a0a79b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/CloakClasp.png/120px-CloakClasp.png?a0a79b 1.5x, /images/CloakClasp.png?a0a79b 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Cloak_Clasp" title="Cloak Clasp">Cloak Clasp</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Watcher</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the end of your turn, gain 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span> for each card in your hand.</div><div class="relic-flavor">A simple but sturdy design.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Golden Eye" data-rarity="Rare" data-character="Watcher" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Scry"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Golden_Eye" title="Golden Eye"><img alt="GoldenEye.png" src="/images/thumb/GoldenEye.png/80px-GoldenEye.png?e99701" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/GoldenEye.png/120px-GoldenEye.png?e99701 1.5x, /images/GoldenEye.png?e99701 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Golden_Eye" title="Golden Eye">Golden Eye</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Rare - Watcher</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Scry" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Scry" title="Keywords">Scry</a></span>, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Scry" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Scry" title="Keywords">Scry</a></span> 2 additional cards.</div><div class="relic-flavor">See into the minds of those nearby, predicting their future moves.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Astrolabe" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Transform Upgrade"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Astrolabe" title="Astrolabe"><img alt="Astrolabe.png" src="/images/thumb/Astrolabe.png/80px-Astrolabe.png?99667a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Astrolabe.png/120px-Astrolabe.png?99667a 1.5x, /images/Astrolabe.png?99667a 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Astrolabe" title="Astrolabe">Astrolabe</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Upon pickup, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Transform" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Transform" title="Transform">Transform</a></span> 3 cards, then <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Upgrade" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Upgrade" title="Upgrade">Upgrade</a></span> them.</div><div class="relic-flavor">A tool to glean invaluable knowledge from the stars.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Black Star" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Black_Star" title="Black Star"><img alt="BlackStar.png" src="/images/thumb/BlackStar.png/80px-BlackStar.png?3767be" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/BlackStar.png/120px-BlackStar.png?3767be 1.5x, /images/BlackStar.png?3767be 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Black_Star" title="Black Star">Black Star</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Elites now drop an additional relic when defeated.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Originally discovered in the town of the serpent, aside a solitary candle.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Busted Crown" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Energy"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Busted_Crown" title="Busted Crown"><img alt="BustedCrown.png" src="/images/thumb/BustedCrown.png/80px-BustedCrown.png?9d5215" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/BustedCrown.png/120px-BustedCrown.png?9d5215 1.5x, /images/BustedCrown.png?9d5215 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Busted_Crown" title="Busted Crown">Busted Crown</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Gain 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span> at the start of your turn. Future card rewards have 2 less cards to choose from.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The Champ's crown... or a pale imitation?</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Calling Bell" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Calling_Bell" title="Calling Bell"><img alt="CallingBell.png" src="/images/thumb/CallingBell.png/80px-CallingBell.png?a7f75c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/CallingBell.png/120px-CallingBell.png?a7f75c 1.5x, /images/CallingBell.png?a7f75c 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Calling_Bell" title="Calling Bell">Calling Bell</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Upon pickup, obtain a unique <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Curse"><span>Curse</span></a></span> and 3 relics.</div><div class="relic-flavor">This dark iron bell rang 3 times when you found it, but now stays silent.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Coffee Dripper" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Energy"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Coffee_Dripper" title="Coffee Dripper"><img alt="CoffeeDripper.png" src="/images/thumb/CoffeeDripper.png/80px-CoffeeDripper.png?81b838" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/CoffeeDripper.png/120px-CoffeeDripper.png?81b838 1.5x, /images/CoffeeDripper.png?81b838 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Coffee_Dripper" title="Coffee Dripper">Coffee Dripper</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Gain 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span> at the start of your turn. You can no longer Rest at Rest Sites.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"Yes, another cup please. Back to work. Back to work!" - The Architect</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Cursed Key" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Energy"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Cursed_Key" title="Cursed Key"><img alt="CursedKey.png" src="/images/thumb/CursedKey.png/80px-CursedKey.png?d408d3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/CursedKey.png/120px-CursedKey.png?d408d3 1.5x, /images/CursedKey.png?d408d3 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Cursed_Key" title="Cursed Key">Cursed Key</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Gain 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span> at the start of your turn. Whenever you open a non-Boss chest, obtain a <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Curse"><span>Curse</span></a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">You can feel the malicious energy emanating from the key. Power comes at a price.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Ectoplasm" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Energy"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Ectoplasm" title="Ectoplasm"><img alt="Ectoplasm.png" src="/images/thumb/Ectoplasm.png/80px-Ectoplasm.png?254170" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Ectoplasm.png/120px-Ectoplasm.png?254170 1.5x, /images/Ectoplasm.png?254170 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Ectoplasm" title="Ectoplasm">Ectoplasm</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Gain 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span> at the start of your turn. You can no longer gain <a href="/wiki/Gold" title="Gold">Gold</a>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">This blob of slime and energy seems to pulse with life.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Empty Cage" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Deck"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Empty_Cage" title="Empty Cage"><img alt="EmptyCage.png" src="/images/thumb/EmptyCage.png/80px-EmptyCage.png?739b6e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/EmptyCage.png/120px-EmptyCage.png?739b6e 1.5x, /images/EmptyCage.png?739b6e 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Empty_Cage" title="Empty Cage">Empty Cage</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Upon pickup, remove 2 cards from your deck.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"How unusual to cage that which you worship." - Ranwid</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Fusion Hammer" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Energy"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Fusion_Hammer" title="Fusion Hammer"><img alt="FusionHammer.png" src="/images/thumb/FusionHammer.png/80px-FusionHammer.png?e0e3b2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/FusionHammer.png/120px-FusionHammer.png?e0e3b2 1.5x, /images/FusionHammer.png?e0e3b2 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Fusion_Hammer" title="Fusion Hammer">Fusion Hammer</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Gain 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span> at the start of your turn. You can no longer Smith at Rest Sites.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Once wielded, the owner can never let go.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Pandora&#39;s Box" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Transform"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Pandora%27s_Box" title="Pandora&#39;s Box"><img alt="PandorasBox.png" src="/images/thumb/PandorasBox.png/80px-PandorasBox.png?712e4a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/PandorasBox.png/120px-PandorasBox.png?712e4a 1.5x, /images/PandorasBox.png?712e4a 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Pandora%27s_Box" title="Pandora&#39;s Box">Pandora's Box</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Upon pickup, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Transform" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Transform" title="Transform">Transform</a></span> all Strike and Defend cards.</div><div class="relic-flavor">You have a bad feeling about opening this.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Philosopher&#39;s Stone" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Energy Strength"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Philosopher%27s_Stone" title="Philosopher&#39;s Stone"><img alt="PhilosophersStone.png" src="/images/thumb/PhilosophersStone.png/80px-PhilosophersStone.png?28b31d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/PhilosophersStone.png/120px-PhilosophersStone.png?28b31d 1.5x, /images/PhilosophersStone.png?28b31d 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Philosopher%27s_Stone" title="Philosopher&#39;s Stone">Philosopher's Stone</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Gain 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span> at the start of your turn. ALL enemies start combat with 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Raw energy emanates from the stone, empowering all nearby.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Runic Dome" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Energy"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Runic_Dome" title="Runic Dome"><img alt="RunicDome.png" src="/images/thumb/RunicDome.png/80px-RunicDome.png?eff708" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/RunicDome.png/120px-RunicDome.png?eff708 1.5x, /images/RunicDome.png?eff708 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Runic_Dome" title="Runic Dome">Runic Dome</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Gain 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span> at the start of your turn. You can no longer see enemy intents.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The runes are indecipherable.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Runic Pyramid" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Discard Hand"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Runic_Pyramid" title="Runic Pyramid"><img alt="RunicPyramid.png" src="/images/thumb/RunicPyramid.png/80px-RunicPyramid.png?b3c035" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/RunicPyramid.png/120px-RunicPyramid.png?b3c035 1.5x, /images/RunicPyramid.png?b3c035 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Runic_Pyramid" title="Runic Pyramid">Runic Pyramid</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the end of your turn, you no longer discard your hand.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The runes are indecipherable.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Sacred Bark" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark"><img alt="SacredBark.png" src="/images/thumb/SacredBark.png/80px-SacredBark.png?ea7218" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/SacredBark.png/120px-SacredBark.png?ea7218 1.5x, /images/SacredBark.png?ea7218 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">Sacred Bark</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Double the effectiveness of <a href="/wiki/Potions" title="Potions">potions</a>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">A bark rumored to originate from the World tree.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Slaver&#39;s Collar" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Energy"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Slaver%27s_Collar" title="Slaver&#39;s Collar"><img alt="SlaversCollar.png" src="/images/thumb/SlaversCollar.png/80px-SlaversCollar.png?f69488" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/SlaversCollar.png/120px-SlaversCollar.png?f69488 1.5x, /images/SlaversCollar.png?f69488 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Slaver%27s_Collar" title="Slaver&#39;s Collar">Slaver's Collar</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">During Boss and Elite combats, gain 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span> at the start of your turn.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Rusty miserable chains.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Snecko Eye" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Confused Draw"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Snecko_Eye" title="Snecko Eye"><img alt="SneckoEye.png" src="/images/thumb/SneckoEye.png/80px-SneckoEye.png?9be98a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/SneckoEye.png/120px-SneckoEye.png?9be98a 1.5x, /images/SneckoEye.png?9be98a 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Snecko_Eye" title="Snecko Eye">Snecko Eye</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of your turn, draw 2 additional cards. Start each combat <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Confused" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Snecko_Eye" title="Snecko Eye"><img alt="Icon Confused.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Confused.png/22px-Icon_Confused.png?dc64fa" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="20" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Confused.png/33px-Icon_Confused.png?dc64fa 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Confused.png/44px-Icon_Confused.png?dc64fa 2x" data-file-width="88" data-file-height="81" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Snecko_Eye" title="Snecko Eye">Confused</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">An eye of a fallen snecko. Much larger than you imagined.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Sozu" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Energy"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Sozu" title="Sozu"><img alt="Sozu.png" src="/images/thumb/Sozu.png/80px-Sozu.png?32ffb7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Sozu.png/120px-Sozu.png?32ffb7 1.5x, /images/Sozu.png?32ffb7 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Sozu" title="Sozu">Sozu</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Gain 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span> at the start of your turn. You can no longer obtain <a href="/wiki/Potions" title="Potions">potions</a>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">You notice that magical liquids seem to lose their properties when near this relic.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Tiny House" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Upgrade"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Tiny_House" title="Tiny House"><img alt="TinyHouse.png" src="/images/thumb/TinyHouse.png/80px-TinyHouse.png?591f4c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/TinyHouse.png/120px-TinyHouse.png?591f4c 1.5x, /images/TinyHouse.png?591f4c 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Tiny_House" title="Tiny House">Tiny House</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Upon pickup, obtain 1 <a href="/wiki/Potions" title="Potions">Potion</a>. <br />Gain 50 <a href="/wiki/Gold" title="Gold">Gold</a>. <br />Raise your Max HP by 5. <br />Obtain 1 card. <br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Upgrade" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Upgrade" title="Upgrade">Upgrade</a></span> 1 random card.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"A near perfect implementation of miniaturization. My finest work to date, but still not adequate." - The Architect</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Velvet Choker" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Energy"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Velvet_Choker" title="Velvet Choker"><img alt="VelvetChoker.png" src="/images/thumb/VelvetChoker.png/80px-VelvetChoker.png?496076" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/VelvetChoker.png/120px-VelvetChoker.png?496076 1.5x, /images/VelvetChoker.png?496076 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Velvet_Choker" title="Velvet Choker">Velvet Choker</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Gain 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span> at the start of your turn. You cannot play more than 6 cards per turn.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"Immense power, but too limited." - Kublai the Great</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Black Blood" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Ironclad" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Black_Blood" title="Black Blood"><img alt="BlackBlood.png" src="/images/thumb/BlackBlood.png/80px-BlackBlood.png?e604f3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/BlackBlood.png/120px-BlackBlood.png?e604f3 1.5x, /images/BlackBlood.png?e604f3 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Black_Blood" title="Black Blood">Black Blood</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Ironclad</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Replaces <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Burning Blood" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Burning_Blood" title="Burning Blood"><img alt="BurningBlood.png" src="/images/thumb/BurningBlood.png/24px-BurningBlood.png?8523b5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/BurningBlood.png/36px-BurningBlood.png?8523b5 1.5x, /images/thumb/BurningBlood.png/48px-BurningBlood.png?8523b5 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Burning_Blood" title="Burning Blood">Burning Blood</a></span>. At the end of combat, heal 12 HP.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The rage grows darker.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Mark of Pain" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Ironclad" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Energy"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Mark_of_Pain" title="Mark of Pain"><img alt="MarkofPain.png" src="/images/thumb/MarkofPain.png/80px-MarkofPain.png?a71d1a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/MarkofPain.png/120px-MarkofPain.png?a71d1a 1.5x, /images/MarkofPain.png?a71d1a 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Mark_of_Pain" title="Mark of Pain">Mark of Pain</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Ironclad</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Gain 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span> at the start of your turn. At the start of combat, shuffle 2 <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Wound" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Wound" title="Wound"><img alt="CardIcon Status.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Status.png/24px-CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Wound" title="Wound">Wounds</a></span> into your draw pile.</div><div class="relic-flavor">This brand was used by the northern tribes to signify warriors who had mastered pain in battle.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Runic Cube" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Ironclad" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Draw Lose HP"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Runic_Cube" title="Runic Cube"><img alt="RunicCube.png" src="/images/thumb/RunicCube.png/80px-RunicCube.png?6af55b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/RunicCube.png/120px-RunicCube.png?6af55b 1.5x, /images/RunicCube.png?6af55b 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Runic_Cube" title="Runic Cube">Runic Cube</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Ironclad</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you lose HP, draw 1 card.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The runes are indecipherable.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Hovering Kite" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Silent" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Discard Energy"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Hovering_Kite" title="Hovering Kite"><img alt="HoveringKite.png" src="/images/thumb/HoveringKite.png/80px-HoveringKite.png?8e4418" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/HoveringKite.png/120px-HoveringKite.png?8e4418 1.5x, /images/HoveringKite.png?8e4418 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Hovering_Kite" title="Hovering Kite">Hovering Kite</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Silent</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">The first time you discard a card each turn, gain 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The Kite floats around you in battle, propelled by a mysterious force.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Ring of the Serpent" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Silent" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Draw"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Serpent" title="Ring of the Serpent"><img alt="RingoftheSerpent.png" src="/images/thumb/RingoftheSerpent.png/80px-RingoftheSerpent.png?9110b2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/RingoftheSerpent.png/120px-RingoftheSerpent.png?9110b2 1.5x, /images/RingoftheSerpent.png?9110b2 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Serpent" title="Ring of the Serpent">Ring of the Serpent</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Silent</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Replaces <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Ring of the Snake" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Snake" title="Ring of the Snake"><img alt="RingoftheSnake.png" src="/images/thumb/RingoftheSnake.png/24px-RingoftheSnake.png?428c38" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/RingoftheSnake.png/36px-RingoftheSnake.png?428c38 1.5x, /images/thumb/RingoftheSnake.png/48px-RingoftheSnake.png?428c38 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Snake" title="Ring of the Snake">Ring of the Snake</a></span>. At the start of your turn, draw 1 additional card.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Your ring has morphed and changed forms.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Wrist Blade" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Silent" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Wrist_Blade" title="Wrist Blade"><img alt="WristBlade.png" src="/images/thumb/WristBlade.png/80px-WristBlade.png?942016" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/WristBlade.png/120px-WristBlade.png?942016 1.5x, /images/WristBlade.png?942016 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Wrist_Blade" title="Wrist Blade">Wrist Blade</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Silent</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc"><span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Attack"><span>Attacks</span></a></span> that cost 0 deal 4 additional damage.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Handy for assassinations.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Frozen Core" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Defect" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Channel Frost Orb"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Frozen_Core" title="Frozen Core"><img alt="FrozenCore.png" src="/images/thumb/FrozenCore.png/80px-FrozenCore.png?d50abb" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/FrozenCore.png/120px-FrozenCore.png?d50abb 1.5x, /images/FrozenCore.png?d50abb 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Frozen_Core" title="Frozen Core">Frozen Core</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Defect</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Replaces <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Cracked Core" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Cracked_Core" title="Cracked Core"><img alt="CrackedCore.png" src="/images/thumb/CrackedCore.png/24px-CrackedCore.png?ede094" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/CrackedCore.png/36px-CrackedCore.png?ede094 1.5x, /images/thumb/CrackedCore.png/48px-CrackedCore.png?ede094 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Cracked_Core" title="Cracked Core">Cracked Core</a></span>. If you end your turn with any empty <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Orb" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs">Orb</a></span> slots, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Channel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Channel</span></a></span> 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Frost" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Frost" title="Frost"><img alt="FrostOrb.png" src="/images/thumb/FrostOrb.png/18px-FrostOrb.png?213701" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/FrostOrb.png/27px-FrostOrb.png?213701 1.5x, /images/thumb/FrostOrb.png/36px-FrostOrb.png?213701 2x" data-file-width="71" data-file-height="71" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Frost" title="Frost"><span title="">Frost</span></a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The crack in your core has been filled with a pulsating cold energy.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Inserter" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Defect" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Orb"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Inserter" title="Inserter"><img alt="Inserter.png" src="/images/thumb/Inserter.png/80px-Inserter.png?793590" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Inserter.png/120px-Inserter.png?793590 1.5x, /images/Inserter.png?793590 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Inserter" title="Inserter">Inserter</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Defect</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Every 2 turns, gain 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Orb" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs">Orb</a></span> slot.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Push. Pull. Stack. Repeat.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Nuclear Battery" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Defect" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Channel Plasma"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Nuclear_Battery" title="Nuclear Battery"><img alt="NuclearBattery.png" src="/images/thumb/NuclearBattery.png/80px-NuclearBattery.png?c4c371" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/NuclearBattery.png/120px-NuclearBattery.png?c4c371 1.5x, /images/NuclearBattery.png?c4c371 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Nuclear_Battery" title="Nuclear Battery">Nuclear Battery</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Defect</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of each combat, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Channel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Channel</span></a></span> 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Plasma" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Plasma" title="Plasma"><img alt="PlasmaOrb.png" src="/images/thumb/PlasmaOrb.png/18px-PlasmaOrb.png?9fcfdb" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/PlasmaOrb.png/27px-PlasmaOrb.png?9fcfdb 1.5x, /images/thumb/PlasmaOrb.png/36px-PlasmaOrb.png?9fcfdb 2x" data-file-width="96" data-file-height="96" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Plasma" title="Plasma"><span title="">Plasma</span></a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Ooooh...</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Holy Water" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Watcher" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Holy_Water" title="Holy Water"><img alt="HolyWater.png" src="/images/thumb/HolyWater.png/80px-HolyWater.png?fe5d62" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/HolyWater.png/120px-HolyWater.png?fe5d62 1.5x, /images/HolyWater.png?fe5d62 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Holy_Water" title="Holy Water">Holy Water</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Watcher</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Replaces <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Pure Water" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Pure_Water" title="Pure Water"><img alt="PureWater.png" src="/images/thumb/PureWater.png/24px-PureWater.png?686c9c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/PureWater.png/36px-PureWater.png?686c9c 1.5x, /images/thumb/PureWater.png/48px-PureWater.png?686c9c 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Pure_Water" title="Pure Water">Pure Water</a></span>. At the start of each combat, add 3 <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Miracle" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Miracle" title="Miracle"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Miracle" title="Miracle">Miracles</a></span> into your hand.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Collected from a time before the Spire.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Violet Lotus" data-rarity="Boss" data-character="Watcher" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Calm Energy"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Violet_Lotus" title="Violet Lotus"><img alt="VioletLotus.png" src="/images/thumb/VioletLotus.png/80px-VioletLotus.png?500406" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/VioletLotus.png/120px-VioletLotus.png?500406 1.5x, /images/VioletLotus.png?500406 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Violet_Lotus" title="Violet Lotus">Violet Lotus</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Boss - Watcher</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you exit <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Calm" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Calm</a></span>, gain an additional <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The old texts describe that the surface of "mana pools" were littered with these flowers.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Cauldron" data-rarity="Shop" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Cauldron" title="Cauldron"><img alt="Cauldron.png" src="/images/thumb/Cauldron.png/80px-Cauldron.png?20897a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Cauldron.png/120px-Cauldron.png?20897a 1.5x, /images/Cauldron.png?20897a 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Cauldron" title="Cauldron">Cauldron</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Shop - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">When obtained, brews 5 random <a href="/wiki/Potions" title="Potions">potions</a>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The Merchant is actually a rather skilled potion brewer. Buy 4 get 1 free.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Chemical X" data-rarity="Shop" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Chemical_X" title="Chemical X"><img alt="ChemicalX.png" src="/images/thumb/ChemicalX.png/80px-ChemicalX.png?34d663" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/ChemicalX.png/120px-ChemicalX.png?34d663 1.5x, /images/ChemicalX.png?34d663 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Chemical_X" title="Chemical X">Chemical X</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Shop - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">The effects of your cost X cards are increased by 2.</div><div class="relic-flavor">WARNING: Do not combine with sugar, spice, and everything nice.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Clockwork Souvenir" data-rarity="Shop" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Artifact"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Clockwork_Souvenir" title="Clockwork Souvenir"><img alt="ClockworkSouvenir.png" src="/images/thumb/ClockworkSouvenir.png/80px-ClockworkSouvenir.png?8a3c8b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/ClockworkSouvenir.png/120px-ClockworkSouvenir.png?8a3c8b 1.5x, /images/ClockworkSouvenir.png?8a3c8b 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Clockwork_Souvenir" title="Clockwork Souvenir">Clockwork Souvenir</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Shop - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Start each combat with 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Artifact" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact"><img alt="Icon Artifact.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/22px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/33px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/44px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact">Artifact</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">So many intricate gears.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Dolly&#39;s Mirror" data-rarity="Shop" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Deck"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Dolly%27s_Mirror" title="Dolly&#39;s Mirror"><img alt="DollysMirror.png" src="/images/thumb/DollysMirror.png/80px-DollysMirror.png?dfce06" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/DollysMirror.png/120px-DollysMirror.png?dfce06 1.5x, /images/DollysMirror.png?dfce06 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Dolly%27s_Mirror" title="Dolly&#39;s Mirror">Dolly's Mirror</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Shop - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Upon pickup, obtain an additional copy of a card in your deck.</div><div class="relic-flavor">I look funny in this.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Frozen Eye" data-rarity="Shop" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Frozen_Eye" title="Frozen Eye"><img alt="FrozenEye.png" src="/images/thumb/FrozenEye.png/80px-FrozenEye.png?a2b85c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/FrozenEye.png/120px-FrozenEye.png?a2b85c 1.5x, /images/FrozenEye.png?a2b85c 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Frozen_Eye" title="Frozen Eye">Frozen Eye</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Shop - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">When viewing your Draw Pile, the cards are now shown in order.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Staring into the eye, you see a glimpse of your future.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Hand Drill" data-rarity="Shop" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Block Vulnerable"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Hand_Drill" title="Hand Drill"><img alt="HandDrill.png" src="/images/thumb/HandDrill.png/80px-HandDrill.png?99b253" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/HandDrill.png/120px-HandDrill.png?99b253 1.5x, /images/HandDrill.png?99b253 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Hand_Drill" title="Hand Drill">Hand Drill</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Shop - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you break an enemy's <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>, apply 2 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vulnerable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable"><img alt="Icon Vulnerable.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/22px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/33px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/44px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Spirals are dangerous.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Lee&#39;s Waffle" data-rarity="Shop" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Lee%27s_Waffle" title="Lee&#39;s Waffle"><img alt="LeesWaffle.png" src="/images/thumb/LeesWaffle.png/80px-LeesWaffle.png?19df2f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/LeesWaffle.png/120px-LeesWaffle.png?19df2f 1.5x, /images/LeesWaffle.png?19df2f 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Lee%27s_Waffle" title="Lee&#39;s Waffle">Lee's Waffle</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Shop - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Upon pickup, raise your Max HP by 7 and heal all of your HP.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"Tastiest treat you will find in all the Spire! Baked today just for you."</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Medical Kit" data-rarity="Shop" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Exhaust Unplayable"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Medical_Kit" title="Medical Kit"><img alt="MedicalKit.png" src="/images/thumb/MedicalKit.png/80px-MedicalKit.png?b85d61" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/MedicalKit.png/120px-MedicalKit.png?b85d61 1.5x, /images/MedicalKit.png?b85d61 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Medical_Kit" title="Medical Kit">Medical Kit</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Shop - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Unplayable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Unplayable" title="Keywords">Unplayable</a></span> <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Status"><span>Status</span></a></span> cards can now be played. Whenever you play a <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Status"><span>Status</span></a></span> card, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span> it.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"Has everything you need! Anti-itch, anti-burn, anti-venom, and more!"</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Membership Card" data-rarity="Shop" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Membership_Card" title="Membership Card"><img alt="MembershipCard.png" src="/images/thumb/MembershipCard.png/80px-MembershipCard.png?9529d8" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/MembershipCard.png/120px-MembershipCard.png?9529d8 1.5x, /images/MembershipCard.png?9529d8 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Membership_Card" title="Membership Card">Membership Card</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Shop - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">50% discount on all products!</div><div class="relic-flavor">"Bonus membership offer for my most valuable customers!"</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Orange Pellets" data-rarity="Shop" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Orange_Pellets" title="Orange Pellets"><img alt="OrangePellets.png" src="/images/thumb/OrangePellets.png/80px-OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/OrangePellets.png/120px-OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1 1.5x, /images/OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Orange_Pellets" title="Orange Pellets">Orange Pellets</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Shop - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you play a <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Power"><span>Power</span></a></span>, <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Attack"><span>Attack</span></a></span>, and <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Skill"><span>Skill</span></a></span> in the same turn, remove all of your <a href="/wiki/Debuffs" title="Debuffs">debuffs</a>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Made from various fungi found throughout the Spire, they will stave off any affliction.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Orrery" data-rarity="Shop" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Deck"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Orrery" title="Orrery"><img alt="Orrery.png" src="/images/thumb/Orrery.png/80px-Orrery.png?ad8d8c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Orrery.png/120px-Orrery.png?ad8d8c 1.5x, /images/Orrery.png?ad8d8c 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Orrery" title="Orrery">Orrery</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Shop - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Upon pickup, choose and add 5 cards to your deck.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"Once you understand the universe..." - Zoroth</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Prismatic Shard" data-rarity="Shop" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Prismatic_Shard" title="Prismatic Shard"><img alt="PrismaticShard.png" src="/images/thumb/PrismaticShard.png/80px-PrismaticShard.png?3616d3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/PrismaticShard.png/120px-PrismaticShard.png?3616d3 1.5x, /images/PrismaticShard.png?3616d3 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Prismatic_Shard" title="Prismatic Shard">Prismatic Shard</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Shop - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Combat reward screens now contain <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?color=Colorless"><span>Colorless</span></a></span> cards and cards from other colors.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Looking through the shard, you are able to see entirely new perspectives.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Sling of Courage" data-rarity="Shop" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Strength"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Sling_of_Courage" title="Sling of Courage"><img alt="Sling.png" src="/images/thumb/Sling.png/80px-Sling.png?8257f9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Sling.png/120px-Sling.png?8257f9 1.5x, /images/Sling.png?8257f9 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Sling_of_Courage" title="Sling of Courage">Sling of Courage</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Shop - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Start each Elite combat with 2 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">A handy tool for dealing with particularly tough opponents.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Strange Spoon" data-rarity="Shop" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Discard Exhaust"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Strange_Spoon" title="Strange Spoon"><img alt="StrangeSpoon.png" src="/images/thumb/StrangeSpoon.png/80px-StrangeSpoon.png?57fad9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/StrangeSpoon.png/120px-StrangeSpoon.png?57fad9 1.5x, /images/StrangeSpoon.png?57fad9 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Strange_Spoon" title="Strange Spoon">Strange Spoon</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Shop - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Cards which <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span> when played will instead discard 50% of the time.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Staring at the spoon, it appears to bend and twist around before your eyes.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="The Abacus" data-rarity="Shop" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Block"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/The_Abacus" title="The Abacus"><img alt="TheAbacus.png" src="/images/thumb/TheAbacus.png/80px-TheAbacus.png?dd69f6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/TheAbacus.png/120px-TheAbacus.png?dd69f6 1.5x, /images/TheAbacus.png?dd69f6 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/The_Abacus" title="The Abacus">The Abacus</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Shop - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you shuffle your draw pile, gain 6 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block">Block</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">One...Two...Three...</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Toolbox" data-rarity="Shop" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Hand"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Toolbox" title="Toolbox"><img alt="Toolbox.png" src="/images/thumb/Toolbox.png/80px-Toolbox.png?4c82b5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Toolbox.png/120px-Toolbox.png?4c82b5 1.5x, /images/Toolbox.png?4c82b5 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Toolbox" title="Toolbox">Toolbox</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Shop - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of each combat, choose 1 of 3 random <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?color=Colorless"><span>Colorless</span></a></span> cards and add the chosen card into your hand.</div><div class="relic-flavor">A tool for every job.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Brimstone" data-rarity="Shop" data-character="Ironclad" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Strength"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Brimstone" title="Brimstone"><img alt="Brimstone.png" src="/images/thumb/Brimstone.png/80px-Brimstone.png?1789d0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Brimstone.png/120px-Brimstone.png?1789d0 1.5x, /images/Brimstone.png?1789d0 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Brimstone" title="Brimstone">Brimstone</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Shop - Ironclad</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of your turn, gain 2 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span> and ALL enemies gain 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Emanates an infernal heat.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Twisted Funnel" data-rarity="Shop" data-character="Silent" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Poison"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Twisted_Funnel" title="Twisted Funnel"><img alt="TwistedFunnel.png" src="/images/thumb/TwistedFunnel.png/80px-TwistedFunnel.png?db98b6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/TwistedFunnel.png/120px-TwistedFunnel.png?db98b6 1.5x, /images/TwistedFunnel.png?db98b6 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Twisted_Funnel" title="Twisted Funnel">Twisted Funnel</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Shop - Silent</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of each combat, apply 4 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Poison" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Poison" title="Poison"><img alt="Icon Poison.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Poison.png/22px-Icon_Poison.png?628f4a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Poison.png/33px-Icon_Poison.png?628f4a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Poison.png/44px-Icon_Poison.png?628f4a 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Poison" title="Poison">Poison</a></span> to ALL enemies.</div><div class="relic-flavor">I wouldn't drink out of it.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Runic Capacitor" data-rarity="Shop" data-character="Defect" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Orb"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Runic_Capacitor" title="Runic Capacitor"><img alt="RunicCapacitor.png" src="/images/thumb/RunicCapacitor.png/80px-RunicCapacitor.png?6243cb" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/RunicCapacitor.png/120px-RunicCapacitor.png?6243cb 1.5x, /images/RunicCapacitor.png?6243cb 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Runic_Capacitor" title="Runic Capacitor">Runic Capacitor</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Shop - Defect</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Start each combat with 3 additional <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Orb" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs">Orb</a></span> slots.</div><div class="relic-flavor">More is better.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Melange" data-rarity="Shop" data-character="Watcher" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Scry"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Melange" title="Melange"><img alt="Melange.png" src="/images/thumb/Melange.png/80px-Melange.png?3cfa5c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Melange.png/120px-Melange.png?3cfa5c 1.5x, /images/Melange.png?3cfa5c 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Melange" title="Melange">Melange</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Shop - Watcher</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you shuffle your draw pile, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Scry" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Scry" title="Keywords">Scry</a></span> 3.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Mysterious sands from an unknown origin. Smells of cinnamon.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Bloody Idol" data-rarity="Event" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Bloody_Idol" title="Bloody Idol"><img alt="BloodyIdol.png" src="/images/thumb/BloodyIdol.png/80px-BloodyIdol.png?64e232" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/BloodyIdol.png/120px-BloodyIdol.png?64e232 1.5x, /images/BloodyIdol.png?64e232 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Bloody_Idol" title="Bloody Idol">Bloody Idol</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Event - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you gain <a href="/wiki/Gold" title="Gold">Gold</a>, heal 5 HP.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The idol now weeps a constant stream of blood.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Cultist Headpiece" data-rarity="Event" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Cultist_Headpiece" title="Cultist Headpiece"><img alt="CultistMask.png" src="/images/thumb/CultistMask.png/80px-CultistMask.png?645aa5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/CultistMask.png/120px-CultistMask.png?645aa5 1.5x, /images/CultistMask.png?645aa5 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Cultist_Headpiece" title="Cultist Headpiece">Cultist Headpiece</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Event - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">You feel more talkative.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Part of the Flock!</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Enchiridion" data-rarity="Event" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Hand"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Enchiridion" title="Enchiridion"><img alt="Enchiridion.png" src="/images/thumb/Enchiridion.png/80px-Enchiridion.png?8b3fd7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Enchiridion.png/120px-Enchiridion.png?8b3fd7 1.5x, /images/Enchiridion.png?8b3fd7 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Enchiridion" title="Enchiridion">Enchiridion</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Event - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of each combat, add a random <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Power"><span>Power</span></a></span> card into your hand. It costs 0 for that turn.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The legendary journal of an ancient lich.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Face of Cleric" data-rarity="Event" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Face_of_Cleric" title="Face of Cleric"><img alt="FaceOfCleric.png" src="/images/thumb/FaceOfCleric.png/80px-FaceOfCleric.png?2f35e5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/FaceOfCleric.png/120px-FaceOfCleric.png?2f35e5 1.5x, /images/FaceOfCleric.png?2f35e5 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Face_of_Cleric" title="Face of Cleric">Face of Cleric</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Event - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the end of combat, raise your Max HP by 1.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Everyone loves Cleric.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Golden Idol" data-rarity="Event" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Golden_Idol" title="Golden Idol"><img alt="GoldenIdol.png" src="/images/thumb/GoldenIdol.png/80px-GoldenIdol.png?362b60" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/GoldenIdol.png/120px-GoldenIdol.png?362b60 1.5x, /images/GoldenIdol.png?362b60 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Golden_Idol" class="mw-disambig" title="Golden Idol">Golden Idol</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Event - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Enemies drop 25% more <a href="/wiki/Gold" title="Gold">Gold</a>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Made of solid gold, you feel richer just holding it.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Gremlin Visage" data-rarity="Event" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Weak"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Gremlin_Visage" title="Gremlin Visage"><img alt="GremlinMask.png" src="/images/thumb/GremlinMask.png/80px-GremlinMask.png?176700" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/GremlinMask.png/120px-GremlinMask.png?176700 1.5x, /images/GremlinMask.png?176700 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Gremlin_Visage" title="Gremlin Visage">Gremlin Visage</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Event - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Start each combat with 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Weak" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak"><img alt="Icon Weak.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/22px-Icon_Weak.png?261352" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/33px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/44px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak">Weak</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Time to run.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Mark of the Bloom" data-rarity="Event" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Mark_of_the_Bloom" title="Mark of the Bloom"><img alt="MarkoftheBloom.png" src="/images/thumb/MarkoftheBloom.png/80px-MarkoftheBloom.png?18ebb6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/MarkoftheBloom.png/120px-MarkoftheBloom.png?18ebb6 1.5x, /images/MarkoftheBloom.png?18ebb6 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Mark_of_the_Bloom" title="Mark of the Bloom">Mark of the Bloom</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Event - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">You can no longer heal.</div><div class="relic-flavor">In the Beyond, thoughts and reality are one.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Mutagenic Strength" data-rarity="Event" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Strength"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Mutagenic_Strength" title="Mutagenic Strength"><img alt="MutagenicStrength.png" src="/images/thumb/MutagenicStrength.png/80px-MutagenicStrength.png?86eb1e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/MutagenicStrength.png/120px-MutagenicStrength.png?86eb1e 1.5x, /images/MutagenicStrength.png?86eb1e 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Mutagenic_Strength" title="Mutagenic Strength">Mutagenic Strength</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Event - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Start each combat with 3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>. At the end of your first turn, lose 3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"The results seem fleeting, triggering when the subject is in danger." - Unknown</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="N&#39;loth&#39;s Gift" data-rarity="Event" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/N%27loth%27s_Gift" title="N&#39;loth&#39;s Gift"><img alt="NlothsGift.png" src="/images/thumb/NlothsGift.png/80px-NlothsGift.png?77a0d8" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/NlothsGift.png/120px-NlothsGift.png?77a0d8 1.5x, /images/NlothsGift.png?77a0d8 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/N%27loth%27s_Gift" title="N&#39;loth&#39;s Gift">N'loth's Gift</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Event - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Triples the chance of finding <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?rarity=Rare"><span>Rare</span></a></span> cards from combat rewards.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The strange gift from N'loth. Whenever you try and unwrap it, another wrapped box of the same size lies within.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="N&#39;loth&#39;s Hungry Face" data-rarity="Event" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/N%27loth%27s_Hungry_Face" title="N&#39;loth&#39;s Hungry Face"><img alt="NlothsMask.png" src="/images/thumb/NlothsMask.png/80px-NlothsMask.png?420bdb" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/NlothsMask.png/120px-NlothsMask.png?420bdb 1.5x, /images/NlothsMask.png?420bdb 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/N%27loth%27s_Hungry_Face" title="N&#39;loth&#39;s Hungry Face">N'loth's Hungry Face</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Event - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">The next non-Boss chest you open is empty.</div><div class="relic-flavor">You feel hungry.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Necronomicon" data-rarity="Event" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Necronomicon" title="Necronomicon"><img alt="Necronomicon.png" src="/images/thumb/Necronomicon.png/80px-Necronomicon.png?8cf1d9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/Necronomicon.png/120px-Necronomicon.png?8cf1d9 1.5x, /images/Necronomicon.png?8cf1d9 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Necronomicon" title="Necronomicon">Necronomicon</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Event - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">The first <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Attack"><span>Attack</span></a></span> played each turn that costs 2 or more is played twice. Upon pickup, obtain a special <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Curse"><span>Curse</span></a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Only a fool would try and harness this evil power. At night your dreams are haunted by images of the book devouring your mind.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Neow&#39;s Lament" data-rarity="Event" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Neow%27s_Lament" title="Neow&#39;s Lament"><img alt="NeowsBlessing.png" src="/images/thumb/NeowsBlessing.png/80px-NeowsBlessing.png?6cbbf1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/NeowsBlessing.png/120px-NeowsBlessing.png?6cbbf1 1.5x, /images/NeowsBlessing.png?6cbbf1 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Neow%27s_Lament" title="Neow&#39;s Lament">Neow's Lament</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Event - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Enemies in your first 3 combats will have 1 HP.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The blessing of lamentation bestowed by Neow.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Nilry&#39;s Codex" data-rarity="Event" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Nilry%27s_Codex" title="Nilry&#39;s Codex"><img alt="NilrysCodex.png" src="/images/thumb/NilrysCodex.png/80px-NilrysCodex.png?11f433" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/NilrysCodex.png/120px-NilrysCodex.png?11f433 1.5x, /images/NilrysCodex.png?11f433 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Nilry%27s_Codex" title="Nilry&#39;s Codex">Nilry's Codex</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Event - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the end of each turn, you may shuffle 1 of 3 random cards to shuffle into your draw pile.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Crafted by the infamous game master himself. Said to expand one's mind.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Odd Mushroom" data-rarity="Event" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Vulnerable"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Odd_Mushroom" title="Odd Mushroom"><img alt="OddMushroom.png" src="/images/thumb/OddMushroom.png/80px-OddMushroom.png?387078" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/OddMushroom.png/120px-OddMushroom.png?387078 1.5x, /images/OddMushroom.png?387078 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Odd_Mushroom" title="Odd Mushroom">Odd Mushroom</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Event - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">When <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vulnerable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable"><img alt="Icon Vulnerable.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/22px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/33px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/44px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</a></span>, take 25% more attack damage rather than 50%.</div><div class="relic-flavor">"After consuming trichella parastius I felt larger and less... susceptible." - Ranwid</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Red Mask" data-rarity="Event" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Weak"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Red_Mask" title="Red Mask"><img alt="RedMask.png" src="/images/thumb/RedMask.png/80px-RedMask.png?af8f76" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/RedMask.png/120px-RedMask.png?af8f76 1.5x, /images/RedMask.png?af8f76 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Red_Mask" title="Red Mask">Red Mask</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Event - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of each combat, apply 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Weak" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak"><img alt="Icon Weak.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/22px-Icon_Weak.png?261352" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/33px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/44px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak">Weak</a></span> to ALL enemies.</div><div class="relic-flavor">This very stylish looking mask belongs to the leader of the Red Mask Bandits. Technically that makes you the leader now?</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Spirit Poop" data-rarity="Event" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Spirit_Poop" title="Spirit Poop"><img alt="SpiritPoop.png" src="/images/thumb/SpiritPoop.png/80px-SpiritPoop.png?a67bd3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/SpiritPoop.png/120px-SpiritPoop.png?a67bd3 1.5x, /images/SpiritPoop.png?a67bd3 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Spirit_Poop" title="Spirit Poop">Spirit Poop</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Event - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">It's unpleasant.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The charred remains of your offering to the spirits.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Ssserpent Head" data-rarity="Event" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Ssserpent_Head" title="Ssserpent Head"><img alt="SsserpentHead.png" src="/images/thumb/SsserpentHead.png/80px-SsserpentHead.png?2554a8" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/SsserpentHead.png/120px-SsserpentHead.png?2554a8 1.5x, /images/SsserpentHead.png?2554a8 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Ssserpent_Head" title="Ssserpent Head">Ssserpent Head</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Event - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you enter a&#160;? room, gain 50 <a href="/wiki/Gold" title="Gold">Gold</a>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The most fulfilling of lives is that in which you can buy anything!</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Warped Tongs" data-rarity="Event" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Upgrade"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Warped_Tongs" title="Warped Tongs"><img alt="WarpedTongs.png" src="/images/thumb/WarpedTongs.png/80px-WarpedTongs.png?4c3fee" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/thumb/WarpedTongs.png/120px-WarpedTongs.png?4c3fee 1.5x, /images/WarpedTongs.png?4c3fee 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Warped_Tongs" title="Warped Tongs">Warped Tongs</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Event - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">At the start of your turn, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Upgrade" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Upgrade" title="Upgrade">Upgrade</a></span> a random card in your hand for the rest of combat.</div><div class="relic-flavor">The cursed tongs emit a strong desire to return to where they were stolen from.</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Accursed" data-rarity="Blight" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Accursed" title="Accursed"><img alt="Accursed.png" src="/images/thumb/Accursed.png/80px-Accursed.png?aa764b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/Accursed.png?aa764b 1.5x" data-file-width="84" data-file-height="84" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Accursed" class="mw-redirect" title="Accursed">Accursed</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Blight - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Whenever you defeat a Boss, obtain 2 random <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Curse"><span>Curses</span></a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Details for this relic will be revealed in the future...</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Ancient Augmentation" data-rarity="Blight" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Artifact Plated Armor Regenerate"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Ancient_Augmentation" title="Ancient Augmentation"><img alt="AncientAugmentation.png" src="/images/thumb/AncientAugmentation.png/80px-AncientAugmentation.png?e29c14" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/AncientAugmentation.png?e29c14 1.5x" data-file-width="84" data-file-height="84" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Ancient_Augmentation" class="mw-redirect" title="Ancient Augmentation">Ancient Augmentation</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Blight - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Enemies start combat with 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Artifact" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact"><img alt="Icon Artifact.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/22px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/33px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/44px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact">Artifact</a></span>, 10 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Plated Armor" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Plated_Armor" title="Plated Armor"><img alt="Icon PlatedArmor.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_PlatedArmor.png/22px-Icon_PlatedArmor.png?647bdc" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_PlatedArmor.png/33px-Icon_PlatedArmor.png?647bdc 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_PlatedArmor.png/44px-Icon_PlatedArmor.png?647bdc 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Plated_Armor" title="Plated Armor">Plated Armor</a></span>, and 10 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Regenerate" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Awakened_One" title="Awakened One"><img alt="Icon Regen.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Regen.png/22px-Icon_Regen.png?59dc78" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Regen.png/33px-Icon_Regen.png?59dc78 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Regen.png/44px-Icon_Regen.png?59dc78 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Awakened_One" title="Awakened One">Regenerate</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Details for this relic will be revealed in the future...</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Grotesque Trophy" data-rarity="Blight" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Grotesque_Trophy" title="Grotesque Trophy"><img alt="GrotesqueTrophy.png" src="/images/thumb/GrotesqueTrophy.png/80px-GrotesqueTrophy.png?f6c6a5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/GrotesqueTrophy.png?f6c6a5 1.5x" data-file-width="84" data-file-height="84" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Grotesque_Trophy" class="mw-redirect" title="Grotesque Trophy">Grotesque Trophy</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Blight - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Upon pickup, obtain 3 <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Pride" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Pride" title="Pride"><img alt="CardIcon Curse.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Curse.png/24px-CardIcon_Curse.png?f11a8c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Curse.png?f11a8c 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Pride" title="Pride">Prides</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Details for this relic will be revealed in the future...</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Hauntings" data-rarity="Blight" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags="Intangible"><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Hauntings" title="Hauntings"><img alt="Hauntings.png" src="/images/thumb/Hauntings.png/80px-Hauntings.png?75fb85" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/Hauntings.png?75fb85 1.5x" data-file-width="88" data-file-height="88" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Hauntings" class="mw-redirect" title="Hauntings">Hauntings</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Blight - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Enemies start combat with 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Intangible" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Intangible" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Intangible.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Intangible.png/22px-Icon_Intangible.png?3d82d7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Intangible.png/33px-Icon_Intangible.png?3d82d7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Intangible.png/44px-Icon_Intangible.png?3d82d7 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Buffs#Intangible" title="Buffs">Intangible</a></span>.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Details for this relic will be revealed in the future...</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Mimic Infestation" data-rarity="Blight" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Mimic_Infestation" title="Mimic Infestation"><img alt="MimicInfestation.png" src="/images/thumb/MimicInfestation.png/80px-MimicInfestation.png?e3e13b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/MimicInfestation.png?e3e13b 1.5x" data-file-width="92" data-file-height="92" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Mimic_Infestation" class="mw-redirect" title="Mimic Infestation">Mimic Infestation</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Blight - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Treasure rooms in future acts are replaced by Elites. Elites no longer drop Relics.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Details for this relic will be revealed in the future...</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Muzzle" data-rarity="Blight" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Muzzle" title="Muzzle"><img alt="Muzzle.png" src="/images/thumb/Muzzle.png/80px-Muzzle.png?89cbdf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/Muzzle.png?89cbdf 1.5x" data-file-width="84" data-file-height="84" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Muzzle" class="mw-redirect" title="Muzzle">Muzzle</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Blight - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">You can no longer increase your Max HP. All healing is halved.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Details for this relic will be revealed in the future...</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Post-Durian" data-rarity="Blight" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Post-Durian" title="Post-Durian"><img alt="Durian.png" src="/images/thumb/Durian.png/80px-Durian.png?d37451" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/Durian.png?d37451 1.5x" data-file-width="84" data-file-height="84" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Post-Durian" class="mw-redirect" title="Post-Durian">Post-Durian</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Blight - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Lose 50% of your Max HP.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Details for this relic will be revealed in the future...</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Scatterbrain" data-rarity="Blight" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Scatterbrain" title="Scatterbrain"><img alt="Scatterbrain.png" src="/images/thumb/Scatterbrain.png/80px-Scatterbrain.png?9202d4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/Scatterbrain.png?9202d4 1.5x" data-file-width="84" data-file-height="84" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Scatterbrain" class="mw-redirect" title="Scatterbrain">Scatterbrain</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Blight - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Draw 1 less card a turn.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Details for this relic will be revealed in the future...</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Shield of Blight" data-rarity="Blight" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Shield_of_Blight" title="Shield of Blight"><img alt="BlightShield.png" src="/images/thumb/BlightShield.png/80px-BlightShield.png?9c9465" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/BlightShield.png?9c9465 1.5x" data-file-width="92" data-file-height="92" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Shield_of_Blight" class="mw-redirect" title="Shield of Blight">Shield of Blight</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Blight - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Enemies have 50% more HP.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Details for this relic will be revealed in the future...</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Spear of Blight" data-rarity="Blight" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Spear_of_Blight" title="Spear of Blight"><img alt="BlightSpear.png" src="/images/thumb/BlightSpear.png/80px-BlightSpear.png?b5e050" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/BlightSpear.png?b5e050 1.5x" data-file-width="92" data-file-height="92" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Spear_of_Blight" class="mw-redirect" title="Spear of Blight">Spear of Blight</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Blight - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Enemies deal 100% more damage.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Details for this relic will be revealed in the future...</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Time Maze" data-rarity="Blight" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Time_Maze" title="Time Maze"><img alt="TimeMaze.png" src="/images/thumb/TimeMaze.png/80px-TimeMaze.png?272835" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" srcset="/images/TimeMaze.png?272835 1.5x" data-file-width="92" data-file-height="92" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Time_Maze" class="mw-redirect" title="Time Maze">Time Maze</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Blight - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">You cannot play more than 15 cards per turn.</di