</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Lose 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Energy" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/18px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/27px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/36px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a></span> permanently.</div><div class="relic-flavor">Details for this relic will be revealed in the future...</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Circlet" data-rarity="Special" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Circlet" title="Circlet"><img alt="Circlet.png" src="/images/thumb/Circlet.png/80px-Circlet.png?b23779" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="80" height="88" srcset="/images/thumb/Circlet.png/120px-Circlet.png?b23779 1.5x, /images/Circlet.png?b23779 2x" data-file-width="146" data-file-height="160" /></a></span></span><div class="relic-text"><div class="relic-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Circlet" title="Circlet">Circlet</a></div><div class="relic-meta">Special - Any</div><div class="relic-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="relic-desc">Collect as many as you can.</div><div class="relic-flavor">You ran out of relics to find. Impressive!</div></div><div class="relic-link"></div></div></div><div class="relic-box" data-name="Red Circlet" data-rarity="Special" data-character="Any" data-ancient-upgrade="No" data-sequel="1" data-tags=""><span class="relic-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Red_Circlet" title="Red Circlet"><img alt="RedCirclet.png" src="/imag